<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">- Gede'o Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Taakkakaa Moyanjuwwiinkaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Moy.</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Moy.</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Moyanjika Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Taakkakaa Moyanjuwwiinkaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Taakkakaa Moyanjuwwiinkaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Taakkaki moyanjuwwiink Maxaafi kuta mitte, lamiinge Samu'eeli Maxaafuwwinaa'ni safendeexxi hexxexxemaxxe Isira'eelike moyanjuwwixxe galchaxxe jirte'n itti aandeexxeni. Kunni Maxaafi giddo hexxeexxi yaanuwwa sase kutuwwa'n qoodema dandetaani.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Solomooni ifike annaxxa Daawwitixxe bakka'ni moyeexxi Isira'eelikenna Yihudiinke moyanjo kadeemmaxxeenna ifika anna Daawwitixxe reyoxxa kulaakeni.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Solomoonxe mootummaka jeejanna isi hujeexxa hujuwwa ege'nishaaxxe jirte kadda wodda, tenne hujuwwanaa'n xalli hiteexxi Yerusalemi'n ijaaremeeke woyyichcha galmani.</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Isira'eel middixxenna bita'ixxe mootumma hiyyende ye'emati lameba qoodendeemaxxenna iitti mitte mittendi mootumma Kirsitoosixxe ilensha edi darre sallane dhibba wogga qico'n moye galchemake moyanjuwwixxeera kulaakeni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Konne lame Maxaafuwwa'ni mitti mittingi akeekisanji iso'n murte murendaammak isi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a leellishaaxxe xuurameessummaxxe qixxe'ntemmani; iittani konne boguwwa bogiki nophphichchinna yaanetixxi qajeela mikemammaki tenne kunni akeekisanjuwwi leellisha'emmaxxe xuurameessummaxxe qixxe'ntemmani; wele darreenaa'n alagiinxa magenoonfachcho hordofanna ajajema gopha, konne akeekisanjuwwanna kadi ooke arda ba'netibaa akeekaammani. Middixxe mootummaki moyanjuwwi duuchchi hega uushshote'n inbe'emmake kadaa wodda Yihudiinke moyanjuwwixxi jirte kinni ookko fuggalessa kademakixeeranna ookke eloke kademakixeeranna kulda'emaxxemman.</para>
  <para style="ip">Taakkake moyanjiinke Maxaafixxi mitte kuta giddo yo'osha ege'nemeekiir, iikki Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe tukke kadeexxi raagiinka hiyyichcho haasoonnammakiinna ardi fakketixxa magenoonfachcho hordofabaashshanna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ajajema gibabaashsha xexxe'achchinsammaxxi shenitte wabeeko hexxemani; insa'ne giddi'n yo'oshsha ege'nemeemmaki Eliyaasite kadaa wodda, isinna Ba'aalixxe qeesenni welti asseemaxxi wo'laancho mitteba kulende'eeni (Haf. Adh. 18) uudi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Daawwitike barrixxa muuxensha <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 1:1-2:12">1:1—2:12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Solomoonixxa mootumma <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 2:13-46">2:13-46</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Solomoonixxa galcha <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 3:1-11:43">3:1—11:43</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Siretixxa wogguwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 3:1-4:34">3:1—4:34</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Galiiminxa huje <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 5:1-8:66">5:1—8:66</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Muuxamiinxa wogguwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 9:1-11:43">9:1—11:43</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Qoqqoodendeexxa mootumma <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 12:1-22:53">12:1—22:53</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Middixxe gosa gosa minixxa jalla <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 12:1-14:20">12:1—14:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Yihudiinkanna Isira'eelika moyanjuwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 14:21-16:34">14:21—16:34</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Wabeeka Eliyaasii <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 17:1-19:21">17:1—19:21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Isira'eelika moyanjo Aki'abbii <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 20:1-22:40">20:1—22:40</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Yihudiinka moyanjo Iyyosaafixxinna Isira'eelika moyanjo Akaziyaasii'i <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 22:41-53">22:41-53</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Adooniyaasi Moyatee Haseexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Moyanji Daawwiti cime gopha'ni dagee ejja buyyinsoolenna midde eeba'emaba'a. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Tennexxee isik erganjuwwi iso'o, «No'oke moyanji'a ergatendaaxxi dubarcho hasenduun; isenna gootta no'oke moyanji'a ergatenduun; bira diiphphe iso'o eebishshuun» hine.<verse eid="1KI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelike boga duuchcha'n dancha dubarrichcho hanseexxi Sunemichcho Abishaagii'i anfe; moyanjiinba'anna isee aa'ne dange. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Tinni dubarrichchonna yo'oshsha danchatemman; moyanjokeenna ergatenda'ni gargaarta'nemman; moyanji kinna isee tuqebaan.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />Eettene yanna'n Hagiiti ildemmak Adooniyaasi, «Ani moyanjoke kadannon» hiyye ke'e; tennexxee sarageelluwwanna iittanni isi edo me'aaka onde tomme manna qophpheesse. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />Anni isikinna, «Maye'e ati iitta assitaatte?» hiyye iso'n ke'e ege'neba'a, Adooniyaasinna yo'oshsha danchakenna Abeseloomike maa'namman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:4">2 Sam. 3:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Adooniyaasi Tsuriyake belti Iyyo'abininna qeesichcho Abiyataarinn welti mari'atee insa'nenna isi'a baassine. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Yaane kinni qeesichchi Saadooqi, Yoodahek belti Bennayaasi, wabeek Naataani, Saami, Reesinna Daawwitik jajjabbi heqqanjuwwi Adooniyaasinni welti guddinebaani.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Adooniyaasi Enirogeeli bira hedheeke Zoheeletike<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni bofiinxe rassa hiyyaten. </char></note> kinji bira gedhebo, korimoolenna ha'yaka jiboottuwwa tolche; dayyuwwa ifika duuchcha, moyanjiinxa labbaxxi oose, iittanni moyatike minike ja'laabuwwa kandemmaka Yihudaka manna duuchcha ye'e. <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />Kaddo malee'e Adooniyaasi wabeek Naataaninna kadi Bennayaasi, moyatike minika heqqanjuwwanna kadi dayyo ifika Solomoonii'i ye'eba'a.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Naataani Solomoonixxa ama Berissaabehi'i, «Gootti no'oki Daawwiti ege'nebaangi Hagiiti ildemmaki belti Adooniyaasi moyeexxa laqqeebexxoo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:24">2 Sam. 12:24</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Ta'a ati ifixxanna belto attika Solomoonixxa lubbo hitta gatisa dandeettattoxxa ate'n kulo. <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />Moyanjo Daawwitibaa martettexxi iso'n, ‹Anke gootta moyanjo; belti atiki Solomooni anibaa uduma moyeexxi moote anxe'ni ofo'laani› hite'e, ‹Ani'a erganjo atixxee'e kakatteettabaa? Eega mayeeta Adooniyaasi moyanjo kadeeki?› hite iso'ni kuli. <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Ati ookko marte'e moyanjoke'n kuldatto wodda aninna dagennexxi ati hiteettexxi dhugaate kaddeexxa kokeessannon.»<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Tennexxee Berissaabehi moyanjo yaanississo'a isixxe kuta giddi'a e'yite; moyanjikinna yo'oshsha cime'emman; Sunemichcho Abishaaginna isi'a ergatenda'emman. <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Berissaabehinna butti'a heeshshi hiteexxi isi edo guluffatte.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 1:16">Moyanjikinna isee, «Maa hassette?» hiyye isse qore.<verse eid="1KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Isenna iso'ni hitee qici, «Koo anke gootta ati ane'ni, ‹Belti anki Solomooni aniba uduma moyeexxi moote anixxe'n ofo'laani› hite'e ati umi atinginninni ane'e eriganjo atixxe'e dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Magenike summinni anee atixxe arganjo'a kakatte'etan. <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Ta'a kunse Adooniyaasi moyo'aten; anke gootta moyanjoo ati kinni tenne yaane egende'ebexxon. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Isi heddo kormoole, ha'yo jibootuwwakanna gedhebo tolche'eeni; atixxa labbaxxa oose duuchchanna qeesichchi Abiyataarinna atike loliinke mannika ajajallo Iyyo'aabinna ye'edheeni; erganjo atika Solomoonii'i kinni ye'ebaan. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Koo anke gootta moyanjoo atibaa uduma gootta anke moyanjiinxe moote'n ayyi ofo'laaxxa ege'nishshota'a Isira'eeliki ardi duuchchi ate'e heqqedhate'n hedheeni. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Tennee assa gophphotole kinni gootti ank moyanji ati rertatto wodda aninna belti ank Solomooni, balleesanotishsha uudemmannoni.»<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Isenna moyanjiki welti haaso'ande'n hexxe'na'a wabeek Naataani dage e'ye. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Moyanjoke'n wabeek Naataani dageexxa kulle; isinna moyanji edo shiqe'e butta wabbi hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Naataaninna moyanjo hiyyee qici, «Koo anke gootta moyanjoo, Adooniyaasi atibaa uduma ate'e moyanjiinxe moote'ni ofo'laan hite'etta? <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Adooniyaasi techchixxe barra'n aade mareexxi heddo kormoole, ha'yo jibootuwwakanna gedhebo tolche'eeni; ate'e moyanjinxa labbaxxa oose duuchchanna atike loliinke mannika ajajallo Iyyo'aabinna qeesichcho Abiyataarinna ye'edheeni; kunse ta'a tennee, ‹Moyanjo Adooniyaasi qeerraaxxa wogga moyi› hina'n isinni welti ita ha'wate'n hedheeni. <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Yaane kinn anee erganjo atika, qeesichcho Saadooqii, Yoodaheka belto Bennayaasinna erganjo atika Solomoonii'i ye'ebaa. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Egedhdhi, ate'n aaneexxi ate'e moyanjo ankixxe moote'ni ofolaaka atike erganjuwwa'n ege'nishshebexxong tinni iitta kaddaashsha ati eettii'i uuteete?»<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawwiti Solomooni Moyaashsha Asse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanji Daawwiti, «Berissaabehi'i ani'a ye'we» hiyye. Isenna moyanji hedhemmaba'a marte isi edo uurrite. <verse eid="1KI 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanji hiyye kakatee qic, «Lubbo anxa rakko duuchchanaa'ni wode'eke hedhaake dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />‹Atik beliti Solomooni ani uduma moyani; anxa bakka moote anxe'n ofo'laan› hiyye. Isira'eelike dada duuchhca ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Gootti Mageniinke summinni ati'a kakateennaxxa kako techcho dhugaaten muuxano.»<verse eid="1KI 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Berissaabehinna butta wabbi hite'e udma moyanji edo guluffatteexxi «Koo anke Gootti moyanji Daawwiti ati duuchchin woddi'a lubbo hedhi!» hite.<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Moyanji Daawwitinna, «Qeesichcho Saadooqii, wabeeka Naataaniinna Yoodaheka belto Bennayaasii'i ani'a ye'we» hiyye. Insa'nenna moyanji edo shinqee wodda, <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />isinna insa'nee hiyyee qic, «Ha'nooke goottika erganjuwwa aaxxine me'itineexxi anka belto Solomooni'i anxe gaange'ni gulufissine'e Giiyooni'anna aaxine dirre. <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />Ookkoonna qeesichchi Saadooqinna wabeek Naataani isoo hariireexxi Isira'eeli'ni moyaashsha assinowwaal; malagatakanna ufuufina'n ‹Woyanji Solomooni duuchchin woddi'a moyowwaal!› hitina'n raarre. <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ha'no isixxa duuka iimi'a qabatte ookkoo'ni dageexxi moote anxe'ni ofo'lowwaal; anxe bakka'ninna galchowwaal; Isira'eeli'ninna Yihuda'ni galcho'a isoo'o fileennen.»<verse eid="1KI 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Yoodahek belti Bennayaasi moyanjoke'n hiyye hiisse haaso'e qici, «Kadduun! Moyanjo anke goottik dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Magen tenne'e muuxowwaal. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti, moyanjo anke goottinn welti hedhemmashshanni Solomoonininna hedhowwaal; moote isixxanna anka gootta moyanjo Daawwitixxe mootenaa'ni saxxeexxa assowwaal!»<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Tennexxee qeesichchi Saadooqi, wabeek Naataani, Yoodahek belti Bennayaasi, Kelitotinna Felito dirne dangeexxi Solomooni'i moyanjo Daawwitixxe gaange'ni gulufinseexxi Giyooni'a aa'ne dange. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Qeesichchi Saadooqinna zayitetixxa buuda woyyichcha duunkaani giddii'ni aadheexxi Selomoni'i hariirre; ookkone wodda malagata ufuunfe; ardi duuchchinna, «Moyanji Solomooni duuchchi woddi'a hedhowwaal!» hiyya'ni cance. <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Ardi duuchchinna suusu'le ufuufa'ninna yo'oshsha gammada'ni isoo'o elqe kayyii'ni qoqqonbe; insa'neeke cancinaa'n kexxeexxeninna buttin lele'me.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Adooniyaasinna isixxi keessumma duuchcha ita haleelendammaxxa yanna tenne'e lanqe; Iyyo'abinna malagati ufuufemaa wodda laqeexxi, «Kunni qachchi giddo laqema'neek hafuuri maachcho?» hiyye qore.<verse eid="1KI 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Iyyo'aabi haaso'ande'ni hedhee'na'a qeesichcho Abiyataarik belti Yoonataani dage; Adooniyaasinna isoo, «Atishsha hedheeki elok manji eloxxa odo laqebaak daga gophammaxxe'e e'yi» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Yoonataaninna hiyye hiisse haaso'e qici, «Waawwo'o Eloxxa odo aadhe dagebo'non! No'ok gootti moyanji Daawwit Solomooni'i moyaashsha asse. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Moyanji Daawwiti qeesichcho Saadooqii'i, wabeek Naataanii'i, Yoodahek belto Bennayaasi, Kelitotinna Felito, isinni welti me'inaasha asse'een; insa'nenna iso'o moyanjiinxe gaange'ni gulufinse. <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />Qeesichchi Saadooqinna wabeek Naataani Giyoonixxe muummeba iso'o hariireexxi moyanjoke assine'en. Ookko'inna gammanda'n fulle; qachchikinna tenneenni gammashsho laqise; ha'nonna laqqine'eek hafuur konnenden. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Konneechchi gadho wele Solomooni galchatixxe moote'ni ofo'le'een. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Mootummatike minik ja'laabuwwi gootta no'okiba'a moyanjo Daawwitiba'a dageexxi ‹Magen atik Solomoonika summa atike summi irra gurra fuleeke, moote isixxinna atixxa moote caaldaaxxe assowwaal› hine eebbinse. Moyanjikinna ifixxe taqe'ni hedheexxi kumbu hiyye Mageno magenoofata'n, <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />‹Techcho moote anxa dhaalaaka ille anxi uuddaashsha asseki Isira'eelik dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Magen saademowwaal› » hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Tennexxee Adooniyaasinna isi ye'emmaxxi keesumma duuchcha alaneexxi ke'ne ora ora'n xexxeeremme. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Adooniyaasi kinni Solomooni'i soodaateexxi mare tolchimalchiinka cunnichcho abixxe. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Solomooni'n, «Adooniyaasi kunse moyanjo Solomooni'i sodaateexxi tolchimalchinka cunnichcho abixeexxi, ‹Ane garbichcho ifika moyanji Solomoon wolaantichchik shiyabaashsha techchonni ani'a kakatowwaal› hiyye'een» hine iso'ni kulle.<verse eid="1KI 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Solomooninna, «Isi me'injo ifika giissedheexxe kaddoole isike umike ordichchonaa'ni mittikinna midde butta ibabaan; balleessa iso'ni afendoole kinni reyaan» hiyye hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Ookkoneechchinni uduma moyanji Solomooni manna ergee'na'a Adooniyaasii'i tolchimalchokenaa'ni dirrinse. Adooniyaasinna dageexxi moyanjo Solomooni'a heeshshi hiyye; Solomooninna isoo, «Kexxe ati mini'a me'i» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Daawwiti Solomooni'a Uwweexxa Akeette</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Daawwiti reyaaxxi barra shiqqemmaxxe'e belto ifika Solomooni'i hiyye ajajee qici: <verse eid="1KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />«Kunse ani manji duuchchi reyammashshanni aninna reyannoxxi yanna shiqqeen; yoona jabaati! Manjoke kadi. <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />Dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Magenika ajaja heqqedhi; assitattoxxi duuchchi ati'a qajeeldaashsha, Muuseke seera'n borreessendemmashshanni ora isike'ninna me'i; aada isixxanna seeruwwa isika ulfeesi; ajajuwwa isikanna galduma isika heqqedhi. <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />Dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, ‹Horte atixxi me'injo iseka heqqexxoole, iittanni mitte godobininna hedho insa'neexxinni ani edo xuurameessummati mammaremoole, Isira'eelixxe moote'n ofo'laaka moyanjo horte atixxenaa'n ate'e gophisa bo'non› hiyye anee addachchisemmaka hiyyichcho ani'a muuxaani.<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />«Tsuriyak belti Iyyo'aabi ane'n asseexxa, iittanni Isira'eelike loliinke mannike ajajaluwwa'ni Nerike belto'n Abeneeri'ninna Yiiteerke belto'n Amaasa'n asseexxa atinni ifi'aani egendeetteni; loli hedhebaangi nage'iinxe yanna'n isi munde insa'neexxa dune'eeni; tennenaa'n kexxeexxa eettene dunnendeexxe munde'a isi qoremaan;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:27">2 Sam. 3:27</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:10">20:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Asiyyo hasissaaxxa afeteke beekkumini assi male'e cimeexxi nage'iki reyo'a waaliddoxxe.<verse eid="1KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />«Dayyo atika Abeseloomi edii'n baajenna wodda eloxxa ani'a assineemmaxxe Gele'adichcho Baarizlaayixxe oose kinni qore atixxa itaake manninn welt indaake kandowwaal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:27-29">2 Sam. 17:27-29</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />«Aninna Mahinayimi'a me'inaa wodda, hinabaaxxa hiyye ane'e badineek Baahuriimi hedhek Biiniyaamichchi Geeraki belti Saami, kunse ati bira hedheeni; ane qophphedho'a Yordaanoosike galaaniba dage'na'a ‹Wolaantichchiki ate shiyyabe'noni hiyyennexxi dada duuchcha ajajamak Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni kakateenneni›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5-13">2 Sam. 16:5-13</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 19:16-23">19:16-23</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Ta'a kinni balleesa afebaake manjishsha assite iso uuddoxxe'e; beekake kaddettaxxe'e iso'n maa assiyyo hasissaaxxa atinni egenddetteni; cime nage'iki reyo'a waaldoxxe'e.»<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti re'eexxi edike ifike annuwwiba'a me'e; Daawwitike qachcha'ninna moogeme. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />Daawwitinna Kebirooni'n torbaane wogga, Iyyerusaalemi'ni sase tommenna sase wogga, mitteba shoole tomme wogga Isira'eeli'ni moye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4-5">2 Sam. 5:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:4">1 Odo. 3:4</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />Tennexxee Solomooni anni ifikixxe Daawwitixxe moote'n ofo'le; mootumma isixxinna yo'oshsha jabaxxe kadde.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Selomonixxi Mootumma Jabaxxe Kaddeexxa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:23">1 Odo. 29:23</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Eettene yanna Hagiiti ildeeki belti Adooniyaasi Solomoonixxa ama, Berissaabehiba mare; Bersabehinna, «Nage'ange'e daggette?» hite iso'o qorte.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:13">Isinna, «Eeti, nage'anggeteni» hiyye hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma ise'n, «Ate'n haaso'aannexxe yaane hexxeeni» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:14">Isenna, «Eloxxeni haaso'i» hite hiissite haasote.<verse eid="1KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Isinna ise'e, «Ani moyanjoke kaddiyyo hasissa'nan, Isira'eelik ardi duuchchi ani mowona'a ille ane'n ugge'emmaxxa ati umi atingeninni egendeetten; kaddo malee yaane dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Gootti darree'ni murendeexxe kaddemmaxxe'e yaane jijjirendeexxi, mootumma anke dayyixxe kadde. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Ta'anna mitte yaane atee'e kadhataannen anee'e hoyyexxoxxe'e» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:16">Isenna, «Haassoottaata» hite.<verse eid="1KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Isinna ise'e, «Moyanji Solomooni ati hitettexxa gibabaan Sunemichcho Abishaagii'i aadhona'a ani'a uwwo'a laqi» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:3-4">1 Moy. 1:3-4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Berissaabehinna «Eloxxen, tenneen moyanjoke'ni ati'a kulannon» hite hiissite.<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Tennexxee Berissaabeehi Adooniyaasixxa yaane iso'ni kuldo'a moyanjo Solomoonibaa marte; moyanji kinna ofo'leebaa'ni ke'e ise'e heeshshi hiyye nage'a aadhe ke'echchi uduma mootete'ni hige ofo'le; moyanji kinna ifixxe ama'a wele moote aadhiseexxi midda ifike'ni ofo'lishe.<verse eid="1KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Isenna isoo'o, «Ani atee'e kadhataannexxe mitte shiixxooxxe yaane hexxeen maganneten gibbe'e ane'e hoyyexxoxxe» hite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:20">Moyanji kinn, «Anxe amaa atee'e shookishabo'non; ane'ni kuli» hiyye ise'ni hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Isenna, «Sunemichcho Abishaagii'i, atik dayyi Adooniyaasi aadheelena'a?» hite.<verse eid="1KI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Moyanji Solomooninna ama ifixxe'n, «Mayee'e Sunemichcho Abishaagii calla Adooniyaasixxee laqqattota? Anke angafa dayyo kademmaxxe'e mootumatanna isi'a laqi; qeesichcho Abitaari'anna Tsuriyake belti, Iyyo'aabi isixxe gamon» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Ookko'neechchin uduma moyanji Solomooni, dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinn hiyye kakateeqic, «Adooniyaasi tenne'e qoremmaxxe reyo iso'ni murema gophphoole Magen ane'ni murowwaali; tennee caaldaaxxanna ane'ni iyye dagowwaal. <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Ta'anna ane'e jabeesseek, anna ankixxe Daawwitixxe moote'ni anee'e ofo'lisheekinna uwwemmaxxe addachiisashshanni tennee mootumma ani'anna anxe horte'a uwweeke hedhaake dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa Adooniyaasi telchixxa bara shiyemaan!»<verse eid="1KI 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Tennexxee Adooniyaasi'i shiyemaasha Solomooni moyanji Yoodaheka belto Bennayaasii'i ajaje; Bennayaasinna Adooniyaasi'i gane shiye.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Moyanjkinna qeessichcho Abiyataarii'i, «Silaa shiyendatoke manjomman, yaane kinni dada duuchchike Duuchchi Woddike Goottika kakotika Taaboota, anna anke Daawwiti edo dulkite'etaxxe'e, anna ankixxa rakko duuchcha atinna welti qoodendettaxxe'e, ta'a ani atee'e shiyabo'non; Anatootike atike fichchiba me'i» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:20-23">1 Sam. 22:20-23</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:24">2 Sam. 15:24</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Tennexxee dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Eelike minixxe'e Seeloke booncho'ni haaso'emmake hiyyichcho muuxo'a Solomooni Abiyataari'i dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe qeesoomanaa'ni hoyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:27-36">1 Sam. 2:27-36</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Abeseloominni welti kadebaang Adooniyaasinni welti gudde'emmak Iyyo'aabinna tenne'e laqe wodda dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottike duukaana'n baajeexxi tolchimalchiinka cunnichcho abixxe. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Iyyo'aabi dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottike duunkaana'n baaje me'exxanna tolchimalchii bira hedheexxa moyanji Solomooni laqeexxe yannanaa'n Yoodaheka belto Bennayaasii'i, «Martettexxi iso'o shiyi!» hiyye ajaje. <verse eid="1KI 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Tennexxee Bennayaasi dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottike duunkaani giddi'a e'yeexxi Iyyo'aabi'i, «Moyanji ate'e, ‹Kabaa'ni fuli› hiyya'neen» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Isinna «Fulabe'non, kabanni reyannon!» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Bennayaasinna, Iyyo'aabi ane'n haaso'eexxi hiissek hiyyichchi konneten hiyyeexxi moyanjoke'ni kule. <verse eid="1KI 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Moyanji kinna Bennayaasii'i hiyye ajajee qici, «Amo, hiyyemmashshanni assi; shiltenna iso'o mooge'e Iyyo'aabi tola boddichcha dhangalaaseexxe qullite mundenaa'ni aneenna anke annika mini hado fulchi. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" />Anni anki Daawwiti ege'nebaang Iyyo'aabi isonaa'n woyo'aaka lame qullichcha manna, Isira'eelike loliinke mannika ajajallo, Nerik belto Abeneerinna Yihudake loliinke mannika ajajallo Yiiteerka belto Amaasaa'a wolaantichchik shiyemmaxxe'e dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti iso'n halo fulaan. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Konne shiyemmake mannixxi munde duuchchi woddi'a Iyyo'aabinna horte isixxa daafowwaal. Yaane kinni Daawwiti'inna sanne isixxe'ni, mini hado isike'ninna moote isixxe'n dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottik nage'i duuchchin woddi'a hedhowwaal.»<verse eid="1KI 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Tennexxee Yoodahek belti Bennayaasi alalle mareexxi Iyyo'aabelii'i gane shiye; isinna qiilla gammooje hedheeke ifike boga'n moogeme. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Moyanji kinni Iyyo'aabixxe bakka'ni Yoodaheka belto Bennayaasii'i loliinke mannike ajajallo asse; Abiyataarixxe bakka'ninna qeesichcho Saadooqii ugge.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanji Saamii'i ye'iseexxi hiyyee qici, «Iyyerusaalemi giddo mine ijaadhite ookko ofo'li; ookko'ni kinni haba'anna ma'itoxxe'e. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Yaane kinni ookko'ni fuldete'e Qediroonixxa dhooqa widi'a qaxxamurtatoxxa barra rertatoxxa ege'ni; atixxe munde'anna laqendattok atendeni.»<verse eid="1KI 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Saaminna moyanjoke'n, «Eloxxen, moyaji ank gootti hitettexxa ani garbichchi atik assannon» hiyye hiisse haaso'e. Isinna Iyyerusaalemi giddo heddo yaanna ofo'le. <verse eid="1KI 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Sase wogga uduma kinni lamiing Saamik erganjuwwi Ma'ikak labbak belti Akishi hine ye'naak Gaatike moyanjibaa baaaje; iikki Shime'iim erganjuwwi Geeti hedheexxa iso'n kulende. <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />Saami tenne'e laqeeshshanni harruwwa koodhdheexxi ifike erganjuwwika hasito Gaati hedheek moyanjo Akishibaa me'e; insa'neenna ookko'o afatee'e ifike minibaa wirri asse hiise.<verse eid="1KI 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Saami Iyyerusaalemi'ni Gaati mareexxi higeexxa Solomooni laqeexxa yanna, <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />Solomooni Saami'i ye'iseexxi hiyyee qici: «Weleba'a me'itattoxxa barra rertattoxxa ege'ni hiyye ani atee dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinn kakachchiise'e, xexxe'achchiiseennabaa? Eettene yanna atinna, ‹Eloxxen, hitettexxa ajajemannon hitee'e ane'n hiissite haasoottettan› <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Mayeeta, dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni kakattettaxxa kako heqqedha gophphette? Ani uwwe'enneka ajajanna mayee'e muuxa gibbette?»<verse eid="1KI 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Moyanjikinna hiisseexxi Saami'n hiyyee qici, «Anna anke Daawwiti'ni assitetexxa fuggoxxa yaane duuchcha godobi atingi ege'ne'een; tennexxee dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atixxa fuggo ate'n wirri assaan. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />Anee Solomooni kinni eebbisemannon; Daawwitixxi moote dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo duuchchi woddi'a jabaattee hexxaan.»<verse eid="1KI 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanji Yoodaheka belto Bennayaasii'i ajaje; Bennayaasinna fuleexxi Saami'i gane shiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:46">Konnee qicin mootumma Solomoonixxi jaba qicinni anga isixxe'n jabaatte.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Solomoon Magenokenaa'n Beekkuma Soodateexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 1:3-12">2 Odo. 1:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Solomooni Gibtseka moyanjo Feri'ooninni welti jaaloommeexxi Feri'oonixxa belto aadhe. Isinna ifika moyatika mine, dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottika galmanna Iyyerusaalemike qariqara'n dalla'a ijaare bira qico'n Daawwitike qachcha'n isee ugge.<verse eid="1KI 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Eettene yanna'n dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summi'a galmi ijaarema gophemmaxxe'e ardi tolcha shiqishaammaki magenoonffachotike gooruwwa hanamman. <verse eid="1KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Solomooni dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddika Gootta eeya'emmani, ifike annixxe Daawwitixxe aada'ninna me'a'nemmani; kaddo malee'e, gooruwwatixxe magenooffachotixxe bakka'n tolcha tolcha'n hixaana guba'emmani.<verse eid="1KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Duuchchinge magenoonffachchotixxe gooruwanaa'n sa'aak Geba'oonite kademmaxe'e moyanji tolcha tolcho'a ookko'a me'e; Solomooni ookkonee tolchimalchoke'n kuma ciincatika tolcha tolche. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Geba'ooni dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Solomooni'n hashsha oojjoti leelle; Magenikinna isoo'o, «Ati'a uwwona'a eettaattochcho duuchcha kadhati» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Solomooni hiyye hiise haaso'e qici, «Anni anki Daawwit dhugaati, qullummatinna qalbetixxe qajeelummani ati edo mammarememmaxxe'e garbichcho atikee'e lumoxxa jaalala uudisseten; tinni lumoxxi jaalala uuritabaashsha assiyyoti telchonna mootete'n ofo'laaka belto isi'a uutete'en.<verse eid="1KI 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />«Ee dada duuchcha ajajaateke Duuchchi Woddike Gootta anke Magenoo garbichchi atik ani Daawwiti anke annixxe bakka'ni moyannoshsha assiteten; ani kinni shiixxooke belto kadeennaaxxee midda bita'a ege'nebe'non. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />Garbichi atik ani, arda atike fi'liteteke, bira sa'ne isixxenaa'n kexxeexxa laakko'a dandeessissabaake tuuti ardi giddo hedhennen. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Tennexxee elo yo'oxxa gargar hiisse'e affiyyoti arda atika galcha dande'annoshsha anee'e garbichcho atikee'e qalbe uwwi; kada gophphoole konne tuuta arda ayyete galcha dande'a?»<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Solomoon tennee kadhatemmaxxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti gammade. <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />Tennexxee isoo hiyyee qic, «Ifi'a qeerraaxxa wogga, durumma alfatee yookaan atiki naaphi reyaashsha kaddebaang, dhugaati galchitattoshsha qalbeefachcho laqqexxettaxxee, <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />tennexxee kadhatetexxa ati'a uwwanon; ayyinna edi darre afebaaka, ati udumanna ayyinna alfabaaka beekumanna qalbefataaxxa qalbe ati'a uwwannon; <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Tennee gadhi darre ati qorteboxxoka qabeennanna ulfinna ati'a uwwannon; tinninna hexxetteke baro duuchcha'n atinni qixxo'aak huun moyanjinna hedhabaashshaten. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Anni atik Daawwiti assemmashsha ora anke'n me'itottole, aada anxanna ajaja ankanna heqqexxottole boro atika qeerisannon» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Solomooninna diiphokena'n dammaqe; oojjo kaddeexxanna ege'ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:15">Ookkoneechi uduma Iyyerusaalemi'a ille iima higeexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottik kakotike taabooti edo uurre; ciincatika tolchanna mittoominka tolcha tolche; jilatanna jileexxi ifika ja'laabuwwa duuchcha itise ha'wise.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Beekkumiinxe Wo'maxxa Dhugaatixxa Murte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Eettene yanna'ni yabaabbulleti galda'emmaxxi lame melaalle moyanijinba dagge isi edo shiqqe. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Insa'ne giddi'ni mitte hitee qici, «Anke gootta, tinni manjichonna ani mitte mine'ninn he'nannon; mitteba he'naana ani labba belto ilennen. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Ani ilennexxe sakkaxxe barra uduma, tinni manjichchonna ilde; no'o mine giddo mitteba he'naannan; no'o lame malee weli manji mini giddo hedhemmabaan.<verse eid="1KI 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />«Tenne manjichchoki belti ise hana diiphpheemmaxxe'e hashsha reye. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />Tennexxee ise hashsha wodhakka kexxeexxi, ane'e atixxi garbitte dhiipho hedhee'na'n anka belto ani birii'ni adhdhite; ookkone uduma ifi biranna diiphilsiteexxi reyeeka iseka belto aaxxe daggeexxi ani bira diiphisse. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Langa barixxa gorsa belto anka unuunsona'a ke'ano wodda kunse reye'e; yaane kinni bogi ifeena'a dhaphphi hiyye isoo uudanno wodda ani illeenneke belto kadebaaxxa afene.»<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Langaxxi manjichchonna «Yaane ati hitaatteshatebaan; reyeek belti atiken; lubbo hedheek kinni anken» hite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Siretixxi manjichcho kinni jabeessite, «Waawwoti! Reyeek atiken; lubbo hedheek kinni anke belton» hite. Konnee qicinn moyanji edo weli moromme.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Moyanjikinna, «Tinni, ‹Ank belti lubbo hedheeken, reyeeki kinni atiken hita'neen; ittinna kinni, waawwo'o atiki belti reyedheen; lubbo hedheeki anken hita'neen› » hite.<verse eid="1KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Ookkoneechchinni uduma moyanji, «Yoona wolaantichcha ani'a iyye dagge» hiyye; wolaantichchakanna moyanjokee iyyedange. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Moyanjikinna ookone wodda, «Amme, lubbo hedheeka belto lameba qooddine'e gamisa mittetee'e, gamisa kinni langaxxee'e uwwe» hiyye ajaje. <verse eid="1KI 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Lubbo hedheeke beltixxi ama belto ifike'e amummatik godobi yo'oshsha mararemmaxxee moyanjo, «Anke goottaa, maganneten, lubbo hedheeka belto ise'anni uwwi malee shiltoxxe'e!» hite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:26">Langaxxi manjichcho kinni, «Ani'anna kadi ati'anna uwwemaba'a; lameba qoodemowwaal!» hite.<verse eid="1KI 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanji, «Amme konnee lubbo hedheeka belto siretixxe manjichcho'a uwwe, shiltinoqqe'e; beltiinxi ama iseteni» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Isira'eelik ardi duuchchi moyanji mureexxa murte laqeexxi, toggitte murte muro'a Magen isi'a beekkuma uwwe'na'a uudemmaxxe'e moyajo sodaante.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Solomoonika Ja'laabuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Solomooninna Moyanji, Isira'eeli duuchcha'n mowe. <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />Umo umoke kadeemmak isik ja'laabuwwi konneechchinn butti'a hedheeken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 4:2">Saadooqik belti qeesichchi Azariyaasi,<verse eid="1KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Shiishaxxi labbaxxi oose borreesano, Eelihoreefinna Akiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 4:3">Ahiluudik belti, jirtetik borreessanji Iyyoosafiixi,<verse eid="1KI 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Yoodahek belti, loliinke mannike umik ajajalli Bennayaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 4:4">Qeese Saadooqinna Abiyataari,<verse eid="1KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Naataanik belti awuraajjuwwink umi ajajalli Azariyaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 4:5">Naataanik belti, qeesichchi Zaabuudi moyanjiink gorsallonna jaalokemman,<verse eid="1KI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahishahaar, mootummatike miniki ajajalli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 4:6">Abidak belti hunnatixxe hujeki towatalli, Adooniraami.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Iittanni moyanji Solomoon moyanjokeenna moyanjiinke mini hadi'a indaachcho Isira'eeli duuchchanaa'ni bukki assaaka tommenna lame awuraajjiinka galchalluwwa afe'emman; kunni mitti mitting wogga giddo mitte mitte agenjo indaachcho shiqisha'emmakemman. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Summi insa'neekinna konneechchi butta hedheeken:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 4:8">Beenihuuri'i, tullichchuwwiinke Efireemike bogik galchalli<verse eid="1KI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Bendeqeri'i, Maqaatsike, Sha'alibiimike, Betishemeshikenna Eloonibetihaanaa'a qachchuwwik galchalli; <verse eid="1KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Beeniheseedi, Arubootik giddo afemaake Sekootike qachchikinna Heferike bogi duuchchik galchalli,<verse eid="1KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Beni Aminadaabi'i, Solomoonixxa belto Xaafatii'i, aadhe'emmake Doorik galchalli;<verse eid="1KI 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Ahiluudik belti Be'aana, Ta'inakinna Megidoke iittann Tsartaani aane'e adaddeshumma Iyyizira'eeli hedheeke Beetishane duuchcha'n ookko'ninna Yoqime'ami wido Abeeli Mehoola qico'ni hedheeke qachchuwwiki galchalli;<verse eid="1KI 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Benigeberi'i, Gela'adi Raamotike qachchik, ookkonni Gele'adi giddo Minaaseka belto Iyya'erike olla'uwwik, Baasaani giddo Aregobik awuraajji iittanni huluwwatike cufana'n sageettotika danqarsanjuwwa afe'eek kinjinke dalla'uwwi buqeme'eeke lumollamma jaane tomme qachchuwwik galchalli;<verse eid="1KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Idoki belti Ahinadaab, Mahinayimik galchalli;<verse eid="1KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahima'aatsi Nefitaalemika boga galchalli; isinna Solomoonixxa belto Baasimaati'i aadhe'emman.<verse eid="1KI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Huushak belti Be'aana, Aseerikinna Be'aalotik galchalli;<verse eid="1KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Faaruwwaki belti Iyyosaafixi Yisakoorik galchalli;<verse eid="1KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Elaki belti Saami Biiniyamiki galchalli;<verse eid="1KI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Uuriki belti Gebeeri, Amoorik ardik moyanji Siihooninna Baasaanika moyanjo Oogike galchina'emmaka gala'adike galchallomman; isinna awuraajjiinke qofike galchallomman.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomooni'a Barra Barra'n Uwwenda'emmaxxa Ita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Yihudakenna Isira'eelike ardik laakkoossi abbaayyatike maanchishsha bira sa'eeman; ardikinna ite ha'wa'n gamada'emmani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:8">Dada. 15:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:26">2 Odo. 9:26</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />Solomooninna Afiraaxxisike galaananaa'n Filisixeemike bogi qico'n ookko'ninna Gibtseke bogixxe gabala qico'n hedheeke moyanjuwwika boga galcha'nemmani; konne boguwwik ardi duuchchi Solomooni'a iribo isi'a uwwa'ni hedhemmake baro duuchcha'n isi'a hireme gale.<verse eid="1KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Solomooni'a barra barrande hasissaammaxxi ita, onde kuma kiilo qicixxi yo'oshsha eloxxi bulle, tomme kuma goofa bulle, <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />Mine falendeexxi tomme sangoole, quffeexxe bada'a'n allalemaaka lame tomme jibootta, mitte dhibba gedhebiinxa koribeeyyenna re'etixxa koribeeyye, iittanni gadansa, buddanne, bada'atixxa re'uwwanna elollamma ci'a. <verse eid="1KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />Efiraaxisike galaaninaa'n dhidhimi darre'n Tifisake qachchinaa'n Gaazake qachchiqico'n hedheeka moyanjuwwa galcha'emmaxxee duuchchi darrenaa'n nage'ik hedha'emman. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Solomoonike baro duuchcha'n Daanii'n Berisaabehi qico'n hedheeki Yihudakinna Isira'eeliki mitti mittingi manni hadi ifixxe woyinetike hiddichchi hundanna ifike balaseti haqichchi hunda nage'iki offo'le hedha'emman.<verse eid="1KI 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" />Solomoon gaare harikisaak fadhadi galaaka shoole tomme kuma dalla'anna tommenna lame kuma fadhado afe'emani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:26">1 Moy. 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:14">2 Odo. 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:25">9:25</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Awuraajjiink ja'laabuwwi agenjo agenjo'ninni bado badoti moyanjo Solomooni'anna isike mowatike mine'ninaa'n itaake duuchchi'a hasissaaxxa ita, mittichchinna xe'yebaangi shiqinsha'nemmani. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Iittanni sarageelluwwinke fadhaduwwi'aanna guluffiinke fadhaduwwi'a hasisaake boonchiba'a sowwakanna hicaace idanga'emman.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomoonika Beekkuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Mageni Solomooni'a beekkumakannaa lumoshsha yo'oxxa galchecca iittanni abbaayyatike maanchishsha ba'laxxa sammo uwwe. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Solomoonik beekkumi borotike mannike beekkumanaa'n yo'oshsha caaleekenna Gibtseke beekkuma duuchchanaa'n sa'ekemmani. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Isinna fedheeke manji caala beekkichchakemmani; Ezirahichcho Etaaninaa'n, Maahoolixxa oose Heemaninaa'ninna, Kelqeedinaa'n, iittanni Daari'aa'inaa'n caala beekichchakkemmani; gurri iskinna qarqarake'n hedheeke gosa gosake arda duuchcha'n laqeme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89">Far. 89</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" />Isinna sase kuma mammassuwwa haaso'e; isixxe faarok laakkoossinna mitte kumanna ondekemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:1">Mam. 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 10:1">10:1</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 25:1">25:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Solomoon haqichchuwwakenaa'n Libaanoosike birbirsanaa'n baxxe dalla'i giddo lataake hisophike hiddichchixxee'e haaso'edheen; iittanni binichchuwwinxe'e, ci'atixxee, godobiki me'amalchuwwixxenna qulxu'muwwatixxe'e haaso'edheeni. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Beekkuma isika laqeeki gosa gosake moyanjuwwa duuchchanaa'n ergemeeki bogi bogik manni duuchchi Solomoonika beekkuma laqo'a dage.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Mageniinka Galma Ijaarate'e Assendeexxa Qophpheeffachcho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 2:1-18">2 Odo. 2:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Xiroosik moyanji Kiraami baro isike duuchcha'ni Daawwitike jaalo kademmaxxe'e, Solomooni anniiinxe bakka'ni moyo'a hariiremeexxa laqee wodda, ifika erganjuwwa Solomooniba'a erge. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Solomooninna Kiraamibaa erga illeema hiisse hiyye ergee qici, <verse eid="1KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />«Egendinemmashanni anni ank dada duuchcha ajajaak Daawwit Duuchchi Woddike Gootta, ifike Mageni'a galma ijaara dande'emmaba'a; tinninna kaddeechchi dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuuchchii Woddik Gootti naapha Daawwitika anga Daawwitixxe'n ibisaaqico'n naaphi isik duuchchi darrenaa'n iso'o adhaammaxxeeten. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Ta'a kinni dada duuchhca ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti anki Magen qarqara anka duuchcha nage'ake asse'en; naaphakanna ba'ne iyyedagaachcho afebe'non. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />Kunse, dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti anna anke Daawwiti'a, ‹Anke summi'a galma ijaaro'a ate'ni aane'e atixxe moote'n ofo'lishannoke atik belton› hiyye haaso'emmashshanni dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Gootta anke Magenike summi'a galma ijaaronna'a hedeenen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Sam. 7:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:11-12">1 Odo. 17:11-12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />«Tennexxee anke manni giddii'ni Sidoonake mannishsha haqqe karatixxa ege'na afeek hedhebaaxxa atinni egendeetaxxe'e Libaanoosik birbirsi ani'a karemaashsha ajaja sa'issi; ank manni atike manninni welti hujaan; atike mannika runda atinni murtettexxe qixxe'n uwwannon.»<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Kiraami Solomoonixxi erga geltee wodda yo'oshsha gammadeexxi, «Konne'e lomoka arda akeeko'a dada duuchhca ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Daawwiti'a beeka belto uwwemmaxxe'e techcho Duuchchi Woddike Gootti saademowwaal» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Tennexxe Kiraami, Solomooni'n hiyye ergee qic, «Erga atixxi ane'e gelte'een; birbirsiinxanna hi'neessiinxa mura shiqisha uuddaaxxe'n hassettexxa duuchcha assannon. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Ank manni mura adadde Libaanoosinaa'n abbaayyati qico'n harkinsaan; aninna mura duuchcha mitteba usurende'e ati heddeteke boonni qco'ni abbaayyate'ni shallallise gelttashsha assannon; ookkoonna usurra tikee'na'a atinna adhdhitatton; atinna anke mootummatike minike manni'a ita uwwiyyoti halcha anxa muuxxatton.»<verse eid="1KI 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Konnee qicin Kiraami Solomooni'a hasissaaxxa birbirsiinxanna hi'neessinxa mura duuchcha shiqisha'emman. <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />Solomooninna kinni Kiraamike mootummatike minike manni'a itate'e lame dhibba kuma kiilo giraama dinne, shoole dhibba liitire qullitte ejersiinxa zayite isi'a uwwe; Solomooni wogga wogga'ninni tenne'e Kiraami'a uwwa'emman. <verse eid="1KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" />Dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Solomooni'i addachiisemmashshanni Solomooni'a beekkuma uwwe; Kiraamixxenna Solomoonixxe oddo'ni eloke mittoomma hedheman; lamiing weli'a kako aange.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Moyanji Solomoon Isira'eeli duuchchi giddii'n hunnatixxe hujeka manna filemaashsha asse; laakkoossi insa'neekinna sase tomme kumammani. <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />Isinna insa'ne'e agenjo agenjo'ninni bado badoti tomme tomme kuma Libaanoosi erga'na'a, agenjo Libaanoosi hunja'n lame lame agenjo ifi ifike mine'n hafuura adhdhina'emman; Adooniraaminna insa'neeke ajajallomman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:18">1 Moy. 12:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Solomooninna tulliichuwwinke boga'ni torbaane tomme kuma ba'o ba'edhaakanna saddeeta tomme kuma kinjo bocaaka manna afe'emman. <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />Iittann konne manni'a umoke kade'e tenne huje towataaka sase kumanna sase dhibba akeekisanjuwwa afeemman. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Insa'nenna moyanjike ajaja'ninni galmiinxe boosoxxe huje'a kaddaaxxa lumollamma, filende filendeexxa kino qonte fulchati bocendeexxa kino qophpheessine. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Solomoonikinna Kiraamik angatixxe ogeki hujaluwwinna iittanni Biibiloonik manni Woyyichchi Galmiinke ijaarsi'a kaddaaxxa haqqenna kino qophpheessine.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Solomoon Galma Ijaarsa Safe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Isira'eel Gibtsee'n fuldeexxe shoole dhibbanna saddeeta tomme wogga'n, Solomooni Isire'eel'n moyeexxe sholgaxxe wogga'n, Ziifi hiyyemaake langeessoke agenjo'n Solomoon dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottika galma ijaara safe. <verse eid="1KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Moyanji Solomoon dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ijaareek galmi, qeernni jaane tomme ciqile; godobi lame tomme ciqilenna ejuma sase tomme ciqilemman. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Galmiinxe lumoxxe kuta edi darre hedheeke soroti ba'linni galmiinke godobishanni lame tomme ciqile kadaa wodda, tomme ciqile gadhi'a fule'ekemman. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Galmakee giddi darre'ni ba'late'e, gadhi darree'n cu'maxxa masikootuwwa giisse. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />Galmiinxe lumoxxe kutaxxe gimo'ninna ookkonee galmixxe woyyo woyyite kutaxxe gimotike qarqara'n sumendeexxa kutuwwa ijaare. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Galmiinxi hundi darrexxe fooqexxe kutak godobi onde ciqile; oddotixxik jaane ciqile; sakkaxxik torbaane ciqilemman; ookkone galmiinixe gimo giddi'a hoboqqi hitabaashsha, hundidarrexxi galmiinixxi gimo oddotixxenaa'n, oddotixxinna xungotixxenaa'n furdattaashsha asse ijaare.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Galmi ijaaremeek ookkone kino qotende fuldemmake booncho'ni qophpheessendeexxe kinonnite kaddemmaxxe'e burrisiink, kino xabbatixxa faase, yookaan wele sibilinke miyixxi qa'weette galmiinkea qarqara laqende'emmabaan.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Hundi darrexxe fooqexxi hula fulde'eke galmiinke bita'a'ni kadda wodda oddotixxe fooqeba'a, ookko'ninna iimixxe fooqeba'a da'misaak riqi hedhemman. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Tennexxe galmakanna konne qicinni ijaare bire; isixxa heellichchonna giddi darre'n birbirsiinke dagalisanjinninna birbisiinke xaawulinni buqe. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Galmiinke sasiinge gama'n ejjuma mitte mittenge fooqeki qeerrinni onde onde ciqile kadeexxa eettene kuttuwwa giisse; tenne kuttuwwanna galmake'n birbirisiinxe haqqeke dagalisanjinni abidise.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hiyyichchi Solomooni'n dageexxi, <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />«Konne ijaartaatteke galmixxe'e, aada anxa hordoffottole, murte anxanna muuxxottole, ajaja anka heqqexxe iso'n galdottole, anna atike Daawwiti'a uwwennexxa addachchiisa ate'n muuxannoni. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Isira'eelike ardixxe oddo'n hedhannoni; arda anka Isra'eelinna waalabe'noni» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Tennexxe Solomoon galma ijaare bire.<verse eid="1KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyyichchi Galmika Ijaarsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 3:8-14">2 Odo. 3:8-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Galmiinxa gimo giddi darree'n buttii'n heellichchoti qico'n biribirisiinke beconni buqe; galminke giddike ba'lina'ninna hi'neessiinka beco faye. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />Galmi giddo udumi darre'n lame tomme ciqile woyyitte woyyo kuta kaddaashsha buttii'n heellichchoti qico'n biribirsiinke becoti golo gole.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:33-34">Fula. 26:33-34</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Woyyottixxe woyyo edi darre hexxeexxi lumoxxe kutak qeeriini shoole tomme ciqilemmani. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Galmiink giddi darri duuchchi biribirisiinxe haqqenni buqemeeke kadaa wodda, kunninna qoonjiinsha hexxeexxe miselek daraaruwwi xabbeme seeseme'ekemman; duuchchiingi biribirisa malee'e leela'nemmaki kinji hedhemmabaan.<verse eid="1KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Galminxe giddonna dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottik kakotik Taabooti hedho'a eettene woyyittixxe woyyoxxa kuta qophpheesse. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Woyyitte woyyoxxi kutaki qeerinninna lame tomme ciqile, godobi isek lame tomme ciqile, ejjuma isexxinna lame tomme ciqilemman; giddirrenna ca'itte worqenni buqe; biribirisiinke haqichchika tolchimalchonna worqeti buqe. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Solomooni galma giddi darree'n ca'itte worqenni buqe; worqeti buqendeexxe woyyitte woyyoxxe kuta edi darre worqetika haachabuwwa dagale leenxise. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Tennexxe galmi giddi darre duuchcha worqeti buqe; woyyitte woyyo kuta giddo hedheeka tolchimalchonna iittanni worqeti buqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-3">Fula. 30:1-3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />Woyyitte woyyo giddonna mitti mittiniingiki ejjumi tomme tomme ciqile kadeexxa lame ejersiinke haqichiinxa Kirubeeletixxa fakke giisse. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Taakkaxxe kirubeelek mitte keelik qeerrinni onde ciqile kadaa wodda langak keelinna iittanni onde ciqilemani; kunninna mitte keelike kasanaa'n langake keelike kasi qico'n tomme ciqile hiyyotemman. <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Langaxxe kirubeelek keelinna iittanni tomme ciqileman; lamiinxi kirubeele gelta qicinna affeexxi bifa mittetemani. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Mitte mittende kurubeelexxi ejjumaa tomme ciqilemman. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Keeluwwa bandeeshshanni eettene lame kirubeele aadheexxi woyyitte woyyo kuta giddo ugge; mitte kurubeelek keeli mitte darrexxa gimo tuqa wodda langaxxe kurubeelek keeli wele darrexxa gimo tuqa'emman; lamiinxe kurubeelek weli keeluwwi woyyitte woyyoxxe oddo'n weli weli kise'emman. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Tennee kurubeeluwwanna worqeti buqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-20">Fula. 25:18-20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Galminxe gimo duuchcha giddixxenna gadhixxe kuttuwwa'n kurubeelixxa, meexxetike haqichchixxanna pha'a hiyye daraareeke daraaruwwa fakke xabbe giisse. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Iittanni galmi giddixxe fawoxxa giddixxanna gadhixxa kutuwwa worqeti buqe.<verse eid="1KI 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Woyyitte kuta'a ejersiinke haqichchinni hulatika cufanuwwa giisse; iikki cufanuwwinna onde kaassikemman. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Lamiinge ejersike haqqichchike cufani hana kurubeeli'i, meexxetika haqichonna daraare pha'a hiyyeeka daraaruwwa fakke xabbe giisseexxi worqetinna buqe. <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />Iittanni Lumoxxe kutaxxe hulake cufani'a shoole kasika ejersiinxe haqqeka mikikkilanjo giisse. <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />Lamiinxi hula mitte mittendi hi'neessinke haqichchiinke maaxafinni welti abidemeeke lame lame cufanuwwa afeeka lame cufana giisse. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Konne cufanini hananna kurubeeli'i, meexxetixxa haqqenna daraare'e pha'a hiyyeeka daraaruwwiinxa fakke xabbe giisseexxi worqet buqe.<verse eid="1KI 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Galmiinke giddi darreka ba'linna bocendeexxe kinonni sase dalanna mitte dala birbirisiinke beconni giisse.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmixxi huje sholgaxxe wogga'ni Ziiphi hiyyemaake agenjo'ni safende. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Tommenna mittixxe wogga'ni Buli hiyyemaake saddeetike agenjo'ni mitte mittendi galmiinxi huje hedendemmashanni muuxende; Solomooni hujetanna huje bireek torbaane wogga'nitemman.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s1">Solomoon Ifika Mootummatika Mine Ijareexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Solomoon ifika mootetika mine ijaare muuxate'e tommenna sase wogga bire. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />Libaanoosike gongoma hiyyemaaka mootummatika mine ijaare; qeerinni dhibba ciliqe godobi onde tomme ciqile, ejuma sase tomme ciqile kadaa wodda, shoole dala'ni uure'eek birbirisiinki utuphuwwi iima heellicho biribirisiinke haqichixxe afe'emman <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Konne utuphuwwi hana sase dala'n shiixxaramma tomenna onde onde kutuwwa duuchiinxi mitteba shoole tommenna onde kutuwwa hexxexxe kadaa wodda iimiin'n heellichcho biribirisiinxe haqqenni kaphendeemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Isexxi masikootuwwanna qephphi assende giissendeexxi sase dala'ninna wele affa'emmaxxemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Huluwwa duuchcha shoole kasika mikikilanjuwwa affeexxenna sase dala'n fuula mitte'n he'nemman.<verse eid="1KI 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Solomoon, «Heddo utuphika lumoka mine» hiyyemaaka mine ijaare; konne miniki qeerrinni onde tomme ciqile, godobi sase tomme ciqilemman; edi darree'ni heddo utuphuwwi kiphateemaxxi heelichcho giissineemmak mammaremaaxxi soro hexxemman.<verse eid="1KI 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Hayyoomma uudaaxxi moote hexxeexxa kuta jaare; tininna murtetixxe ba'laxxe kuta hiyyendeexxen; iseenna buttii'ni heellichoti qico'n birbirisiinke beconni buqe. <verse eid="1KI 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />Giddii'n ba'laxxe kuta udumi darre'ni hedheeke ba'lina'ni mootummatika mine ifi'a ijaare; Solomoon aadheexxe Feri'oonixxe belto'a konne'e mootummatika mine labbaaxxa ba'laxxa kuta jaare.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:1">1 Moy. 3:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Kunni tenne mitte baxxe'n hedheek minuwwi buttii'n dinidimaateti qico'n hedheeke minik ijaarsi duuchchi boceme giddi gadhii'n weli qixxe qunqumeme seesemeeke fiixeeke kinjinni ijaaremeekemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Booso isixxinna tomme yookaan saddeeta ciqile qeerrinne afe'eeke elolla lumolamma kinon ijaaremeekemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Tenne lumolamma kino iima yo'oshsha elolla qunqumendeexxi kinonna birbirisiink beco hexxemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmik giddi darrek ba'lin mammaremaammake soronni welti lumoke ba'linnishanni seesende bocendeexxe sase dalixxe kinoninna qunqumemeeke mitte dalike birbirisiinke beconni golleme'ekemman.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galimi Giddika Mi'uwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Moyanji Solomooninna erganjo ergeexxi Huraami hiyyemaaka manjichcho Xiroosi'ni dagaashsha asse. <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />Kaamixxi ama Nefitaalemixxe gosaxxe manjo kadda wodda, isenna aro'o affemmabaaxxe hiyyeetemman; isiki anninna Xiroosike bogike manjo kadaa wodda, sageettotika sibiljo baqisatixxe ogeke manjomman; Kiraami sageetto baqisatixxa heene hujeka beekkuma, dande'anna ege'na afe'eemmake manjomman; isinna moyanjo Solomoonibaa dageexxi isi'a uwwendeexxa huje duuchcha huje bire.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sageettoti Giissemeeka Lame Utupha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 3:15-17">2 Odo. 3:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Kiraami mitti mittingi ejuma tommenna saddeeta ciqile, dowwetinna tommenna lame ciqile kadeeka lame sageettotike sibiljika utupha giise. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Iittanni utuphuwwiinxe guuto'ni uggendaaxxa lame bokko baqinseexxe sageetton giisse; Mitte mitte bokkoxxi ejuma onde qicilemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Utuphuwwiinxe guuto'ni hana hexxeexxe bokkuwwake seesa kaddaashsha mitte mittende'e torbaane marabetika haachchaba giisse. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />Iittanni Utuphake'ni hana hexxeexxa bokkuwwa seesate'e mitte mittende marabexxe dowwe'n dooteexxa Roomanuwwa lame dala'ni giisse; lamiinxe bokkuwwa'n asseexxi yaane weli fakkaattaaxxemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Barandake'n hedhemmake utuphuwwixxe guuto'n hexxeexxi bokkuwwaxxi ejjuma shoole ciqile kadda wodda, suufetike daraarixxe misilekemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Mitte mittinge lame utuphuwwixxe marabetixxe bokkuwwaxxe dowwe duuchcha'ni lame lame dhibba roomaanuwwa dalake'n hexxemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Utuphuwwakanna galmiinke baranda'n uurrise; middi darree'ni uurseeka utupha Yakin,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakimi hiyya Ibritotike laagadinni Magen no'oo jabeese uurse hiyyate</char></note> bita'i darreka Boo'ezi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boo'ezi hiyya Ibritotike laagadinni isixxe hunnanni hiyyaten</char></note> hiyye summa fulche <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Guutote'n hexxemmaxxi bokkuwwa suufetike daraarixxe misilemman; Utuphuwiinxi huje konne qicinni muuxende.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sageettoti Hujemeeka Gonga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 4:2-5">2 Odo. 4:2-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Mitte kasakenaa'ni mitte kasii qico'n godoba tomme ciqile, ejjumia onde ciqile kade'eekanna isixxe wirto sase tomme ciqile kade'eka kuku'michcha gonga baqisemeeke sageettotike sibilijin giisse; <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Gongiinke afo'i buttidarre, mitte mitte ciqileke'n qoonjishsha hexxeexxi tomme misiluwwa qarro gongiinxe'n lame dalin dalde'een; kunnichchuwwinna gongik welit mitte biso kadeexxi lame dala'ni giissine'emmaken.<verse eid="1KI 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Gongi kinna, sasi middi darree'n, sasi dhidhimi darree'n, sasi bita'i darree'n sasi boroti darree'n alba wirri hiteexxe tommenna lame korommexxe misile hana ofo'le'eeke kadaa wodda, gongi tenne koromme hana hedheekei kadda wodda duuchchiingixxi udumi darreki gong hundii'n giddi darre'n gata'emman. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Gongiinki furdinni saddeeta sentimetre qico kadaa wodda, isike afo'ik irgi kinni daraariinxe misileshsha hedheexxi afo'iinba siinetike afo'o fakkaata'emman; isinna shoole tommenna lame kuma leetiro wode'e abida'emmakemman.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Iittanni mitte boonchonaa'n wele boobchiba'a me'aaka moletika tomme miyiinka offo'lisanjuwwa sageettotike sibiljika giisse; mitti mittingiki qeerrinni shoole ciqile, godobi shoole ciqile, ejjuma sase ciqileman. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Miyink offo'lisanjuwwi giisseme'emma qici: kunni offo'lisanji shoole kasike kadeexxi shoole lekkuwwa afe'emman; kunni shooling gami gamike kasuwwi welt bexxichcha sageettotike sibiluwwi abidememman. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Gama gamake'n hexxeexxe lekkuwwaxxe oddo'ni hedheeke sageettotike bexxichcha sibiluwwa'n neenquwwiinxa, laliinxe kormoolexxanna Kurubeeletixxa misile giisse; tenne neenquwwinna laliinxe kormoole iimi darre'ninna butti darre daraariinke seesike luuphisa fakkataaxxi tumende giissendeemmaxxe misiluwwa hexxemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Mitti mittingi miyiink offo'lisanji shoole sageettotike sibiljixxa molenna moluwwa itti wirri wirri hitaaka sageettotika sibiljuwwika wirwisama afe'emman; iittanni mitte mitteng ansheccatike gongik shooliini darree'ni abidisemeemmaxxe dhaaddo afe'emman; tenne dhaadduwwa'n darariinke seesika luuphisa misilenni seeseme'emman. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Anshe'namake gongik afo'ik ba'linni tommenna saddeetta ciqileman; isinna kukubbichcha afo'ikemman; qeerinkinna shoole tomme ciqilman; afo'iinbanna ququbichchake kadeexxi gonga dunkamaalchinna bexxichchake malee'e gubiinkemmabaan. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Shoollnixxi moluwwa, sageetotike sibiljika miyiinka bexxichcha ofo'lisanji hundidarre'n gattaaxxe kadda wodda moluwwatike wirsamuwwi kinni miyinke ofo'lisanjuwwinni mitteba abidisemeekemman; mitte mittende molek godobinna mittenna gamisa ciqilemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Moluwwa, fadhadiinxe gaarexxa moluwwa fakkaattaxxe kadda wodda, isek wirsamuwwi, iseki irguwwinna isexxi bobuwwa iittanni kinni wirwirsamuwwi giddo e'yaak baanbuwwi duuchchi baqisemeeke sibiljikemman.<verse eid="1KI 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Mitti mitting miyink offo'lisanji shooliinge kasa'n shoole abixxatika fannichcho afe'emman; fannichchuwwikinna miyiinke ofo'lisanjo'n abidiseme giisseme'ekemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Miyiinke ofo'lisajixxe guutoxxe dowwe'n gamisa ciqile kaddaaxxi kuku'mitte misile hexxemman; ofo'lisanjo isikixxi lekkuwwanna isik bexxichchi sageettotike sibiljuwwi ofo'lisanjixxe guutonni welti abidiseme'emakemman. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Isinna tenne lekkuwwa'n hananna tenne sageettotike bexxichchi sibiluwwi hana hexxeexxe duuchcha bakkaxxe dowwe'n daraariinke seesixxa luuphisa kurubeelinna meexxetike haqichchixxa misiluwwa giisse. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Tommiinge miyinki ofo'lisanjuwwi giissemeeki konne qici'nitemman; duuchchiingechchi mitte dhagga'n baqiseme'e fulechcho kadeemmaxxe'e jifo insa'neexxinna seesi weli qixxe kaddeemmaxxe'e duuchiingi mitte kutamman.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Isi ookkoneechchi uduma mitte mittenge miyike offo'lisanji'a dhibbanna saddeeta tomme liitire abidaaka tomme sageettotike sibiljika ansheccatika gonga giisse; mitti mittingiki godobi shoole ciqilemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:17-21">Fula. 30:17-21</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Onde miyika offo'lisanjuwwa galmakenaa'n bita'i darre'n ugge; onde middi darre'ni, anshecatika gonganna galmakenaa'n bita'i darrexxe borroke kasa'n bita'i darre'n ugge.<verse eid="1KI 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyyichcha Galmike Miyuwwika Laakkoossa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 4:11-5:1">2 Odo. 4:11—5:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Iittanni odowwa, akkaffuwwakanna distuwwa giisse.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:40">Huuram konneqicinni moyanjo Solomooni'a ijaareeka dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottike Galmixxa huje konneechchinni butti'a hexxeeshsha muuxe:<verse eid="1KI 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />Lami utuphuwwi, utuphuwwiinxe guuto'n hana giissendeexxi lame kuku'mitte bokkuwwa, utuphuwwiinxe guuto'n hana giissendeexxi lame kuku'mitte bokkuwwa danchositeexxi lame marabuwwa;<verse eid="1KI 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />Utuphuwwiinxe guuto hana hexxeexa lame bokkuwwa buqaashsha, mitte mitte marabe'a lame lame dala asseexxi lame marabe'a shoole dhibba roomaanuwwa; <verse eid="1KI 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />Tomme miyinka offo'lisanjuwwa konne offo'lsanjuwwa'n hana hedhemmaka tomme ansheccatika gonguwwa <verse eid="1KI 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />wode'e camatika gandanna hundi darre'n tommenna lame korommuwwaxxa misiluwwa; <verse eid="1KI 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />distuwwa, akkaffuwwakanna hubbuqqichcha sahinuwwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:45">Huraami dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmixxe huje'a kadaashsha konne mi'uwwa duuchcha moyanjo Solomooni'a giisseek ganganeme'e calacala hiyya'neeke sageetotike sibiljinniten. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Moyanji Solomooni konne sageettotike sibiljika miyuwwa sageettotika sibiljo baqise'e faariinke miyixxa bifa afaashsha faarinke miyi giddo duneme'ek Sukootixxenna Tsartaanixxe oddo'n hexxeexxe Yordaanoosixxe dhooqa'niten. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Solomoon konne mi'uwwa a'urekenaa'n kexxeexxa kiilemaashsha asseba'a; tennexxee sageettotike sibiljik a'urri hitteeke kade'emmaxxa ege'neme'emmaba'a. <verse eid="1KI 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Solomoon dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmi giddo hedhemmaka konneechchinni butti'a hedheeka miyuwwa duuchcha giisse:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 7:48">Worqetika tolchi booncho, Magenoke shiqqaaxxe indaachcho hana hexxaaka worqetika beera;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Fula. 25:23-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 30:1-3">30:1-3</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />Woyyo woyyitte edidarre</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 7:49">Onde middidarre'n, onde bita'i darre'n hedhaaka ca'itte worqeka torbaane dhankoka xassa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 7:49">worqetika daraaruwwa, worqetike xassike ofo'lisanjuwwanna worqetika giirati tunqisanjuwwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Fula. 25:31-40</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />Ca'itte worqexxa qoruwwa, xassa xolsamalchuwwa, distuwwa, hixaana shiqnishachchuwwa, mooqquwwa, giira ha'ilshinaachuwwa, giddixxe kuta'a woyyitte woyyoke cufanuwwi'anna iittanni galmikke cufanuwwi'a kadaakia maxaafuwwa giisse.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Moyanji Solomoon, dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Gootike galmixxa huje duuchcha muuxeechi uduma anni isik Daawwiti gargar foyeemmaka birretika sibilonna worqe, iittanni wele miyuwwa duuchcha aadhe iyyedageexxi dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmi giddo ugge.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:11">2 Sam. 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 18:11">1 Odo. 18:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Galmi Giddi'aa Taabootiinxa E'ya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 5:2-6:2">2 Odo. 5:2—6:2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanji Solomoon Duuchchi Woddike Goottika kakotika taaboota Daawwitike qachcha Tsiyooninaa'ni iyyedagate'e Isira'eelixxa geedhuwwa, Isira'eelixxe gosake mini mininka akeekisanjuwwanna Isira'eelike ardika ja'laabuwwa duuchcha isi hedheeba'a Iyyerusaalemi'a dango'a ye'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:12-16">2 Sam. 6:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25-29">1 Odo. 15:25-29</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Ayyaani ulfeessemammake Etaami hiyyemaake torbake agenjo'ni Isira'eelik labballi duuchchi moyanji Solomoon hedheeba'a bukki hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:24">Lew. 23:24</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Isira'eelixxi geedhuwwa duuchcha daggee wodda qeesole kakotika taabota dulkite. <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottika kakotika taabota, Duuchchi Woddike Goottika afenshaxxa duunkaananna ise giddo hedheeka woyyichcha miyuwwa idange; qeesoletinna Leewwito konne miya duuchcha dulkite. <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Moyanji Solomooninna isinni welti ookko'o bukki hiyye'emmak Isira'eelki ardi duuchchi kakotike taaboti edo hedhiyyoti laakkoossi iimi darre hedheeka gedhebokanna lalo tolchine.<verse eid="1KI 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Ookkoneechchi udumi'a qeesole Duuchchi Woddike Goottika kakotika taaboota iyyedaggeexxi galmi giddo hexxeexxe isixxe woyyo woyyite bakka'n e'yishsheexxi kurubeelike keeli hunda uggitte. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Kurubeeluwwanna kakotik taabooti hedhemmake boonchi hana keela ifika bandeexxi kakotika taabotanna isika dukisanjuwwa murge buqqe <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Murguwwatik qeerinnenaa'ni kexxeexxa isexxi qaccuwwa galmi giddo woyyo woyyitte edi darree'n leellita'emman; galmii'n gadhidarre hedheeki manji kinni isee'e afa'emmaba'a; murguwwatinna telchi qico'n ookkoonni hexxeen. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Isira'eelik ardi Gibtsee'n fule wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelike ardinni welti kako aagemmaba Koorebi, Muuse kakotike taaboti giddo uggemmaxxa lame bocendeexxa kino malee'e kakotike taabooti giddo mittilchchinna hedhemmabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:5">Lew. 10:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Qeesole galmi giddii'ni fulde wodda duumanchchi Duuchchi Woddike Goottika galma wo'me. <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik ulfinni galmi giddo wo'meemmaxxe'e, qeesole duumanchakenaa'n kexxeexxa ergatema dandeetteba'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34-35">Fula. 40:34-35</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />Ookkone wodda Solomoon hiyyee qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti dimma duumanchi giddo hedhaaxxa haaso'eedheen;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:11">Far. 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:2">97:2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Kunseten ani duuchchin woddi'a hexxattoka ulfichcha galma ati'a ijaareennen» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomooni Ardake'e Haaso'eeka Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 6:3-11">2 Odo. 6:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Isira'eeliki bukki hiyyeeki ardi duuchchi ookko'o uurre heedheena'a moyanji alba insa'neeba'a wirri hiyyeexxi insa'ne'e eebbise. <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />Ookkoneechinni uduma hiyyee qici, «Anna anke Daawwiti'a afo'o ifikenni addachchiise haaso'eexxi anga ifixxenni muuxxeek Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelik Magen saademowwaal. Isinna hiyyeemma qici <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />‹Arda anka Isira'eeli'i Gibtsee'n fulcheennexxe barranaa'ni summi anki ye'emaabanna galmi ank ijaaremaaxxa bakka Isira'eelixxe gosake minike qachchuwwi duuchchanaa'ni mitte qachchanna filebe'non; Arda anka Isira'eeli'i akeekaashsha kinni Daawwiti'i fi'lenne› » hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:4-11">2 Sam. 7:4-11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:3-10">1 Odo. 17:3-10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />«Anni anki Daawwiti Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike Magenike summi'a galma jaaro'a godobik hede'emman; <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kinni anna anka Daawwiti'i hiyyee qici, ‹Anke summi'a galma ijaarate'e heddeettaxxe'e, tennee godoba atike'n heda eloxxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Sam. 7:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:11-12">1 Odo. 17:11-12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Kaddo malee'e galma ijaartattok atete kaddeboxxok ati i'litattoke atike belton; eetti anke summi'a galma ijaaraak isoten› hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Sam. 7:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:11-12">1 Odo. 17:11-12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />«Duuchchi Woddik Gootti haaso'exxa addachchiisa muuxe'een; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti haaso'eexxe addachiisashanni anna ankixxe bakka'ni Isira'eelike moyanjo kadeennen; iittanni Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike Magenike summi'anna galma ijaareennen. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Gibtsee'n edika annuwwa no'oka fulchee wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'ne'a aagemmaxxe kako giddo hedheek kakotik taabooti hedheeka booncho ookko qophpheesseennen» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomoon Mageniinba'a Soodateexxa Soodachcho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 6:12-42">2 Odo. 6:12-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Solomooni Isira'eelike bukki hiyyeek ardi duuchchi hedheeba, Duuchchi Woddike Goottike tolchimalchi edo uurreexxi angatanna iimi'a farri asse'e <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 8:23">«Ee Duuchchi Woddike Gootta, Isira'eelike Mageno ati edo mitte godobinni hedhaake atike erganjuwwi'a aaggettaxxa kako muuxxattokinna, jabaxxa atixxa jaalala leeliishshattokee, ale iimate'n buttanna buttate'n atishsha hedheek Mageni hedhebaan. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />Erganjo atike Daawwiti'i anke anni'a haasoottettexxa addachchiisa guuttee'etten; afo'o atiken haasootte'e, haasoottettaxxanna anga atixxenni techchixxe barra'ni muuxxe'etten.<verse eid="1KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />«Ta'anna ee dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Isira'eelike Magenoo erganjo atike Daawwiti'i anna anka, ‹Ati assitettaaxxa duuchcha, oose atixxi ani edo mammarenda'n assitaaxxe duuchcha'n xexxe'attoole calla malee Isira'eelixxe moote hana ani edo ofo'laaka manjo gophphaboxxoni› hita'ni haasoottettexxa addachchiisa isi'a muuxi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">1 Moy. 2:4</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Ta'anna, ee Isira'eelike Magenoo erganjo atike anna anke Daawwiti'a haasoottettexxi addachchiisa muuxendowwaal.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />«Yaane kinni dhugaandinni Magen buttati hana hedhaasi? Wele waalini iima, iimuwwati iimi darre hexxeexxi iimanna midde atee'e dandeette aaxxabaan; ani ijaarenneki kunni galmi fa'i maata heeno'ma gophuu!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:6">2 Odo. 2:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Kaddoolenna ee Duuchchi Woddik Gootta anke Magenoo anee'e erganjo atikixxa soodachchonna kadha laqi; telchixxe barra'ni erganji atik ani ati edo shiqishaanexxa oodhishanna kadha caqasi. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />Ani erganji atiki konne boonchibaa shiqishaanneexxa soodachcho laqqota'a, ‹Summi ank ookko hedhaan› hitettexxe tenne bakka'n hedheeke konne galmiba'a ille atixxi hashsha barra uuddowwaal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:11">Lan. 12:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Ani eerganji atikinna ardi atik Isira'eel tenne bakkaba'a soodantanno wodda kadha no'oxxa laqi; atike galduma kaddeexxe iimanaa'n laqi; laqqenna no'o'a gattowwaal hiyyi.<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />«Manji mitti jaalo ifika miidhe'eeshsha uudemeexxi kakato'a dage'e konne Galmi giddo tolchimalchi edo kakata wodda, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />tenne'e iimate'ni hexxe laqi; konne erganjuwwa atike'ninna murte uwwi; tinninna balleesa afendeeka manjo, huje isixxishshanni iso'n muri; balleessa afendebaakanna, balleessa afa gopha isixxa kokeesati qullumma isixxika hira isi'anna uwwi.<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />«Ardi atik Isira'eel atee'e balleessatenaa'ni kexxeexxa, ifike naapha'ni injifatema wodda, faaci'e atiba higeexxi summa atika ulfeessoole, konne galmi giddonna atibaa soodatoolenna atiba'a kadhatoole, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />iimate'n hexxe laqi; arda atikixxa Isira'eelixxa cubbo gattoowwal hiyyi; annuwwa insa'neeke'e uuteteke bogibaanna insa'ne'e illeema hiissi.<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />«Ardikinna atee'e balleesatenaa'ni kexxeexxa, iima cufende'e xeeni gana gophexxee'e konne boonchiba soodatoolenna summa atika ye'edhoole, rakkissettaxxeenna balleessa ifixxenaa'ni higoole, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />iimatenaa'n laqi; erganjuwwa atika arda atika Isira'eelixxa cubbo gattowwal hiyyi; me'iyyo hasisaaka toggichcha ora insa'ne'e barsiisi; geego kadaashsha arda atikee'e uutettake boga'ninna xeena gansiisi.<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />«Bogake'n solo'i yookaan bala dagga wodda, waage yookaan buquni kadaa wodda, awwaaneessi yookaan isixxi shiixxaramma beltanna bogake'n daggaa wodda yookaan bogi giddo hedheeke qachchuwwa naaphi buqoole iittanni hiini ba'ne yookaan dhukkubi dagaa wodda, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />Arda atike Isira'eelinaa'n feedheek manji godoba ifikixxe yaaddo'a anga ifixxa konne miniba'a farri asse soodataa wodda yookaan kadhataa wodda duuchcha, <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />Atike galduma iimate'ni hexxe laqi; gattowwaalinna hiyyi; gargaar. Atinn calli manji duuchchikae godobika yaado egendeettaxxe'e mitte mittienge manji'a huje huje isixxishanni hira uwwi. <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />Tinninna insa'ne annuwwa no'okee'e uutettake boga'n he'naaxxa yanna duuchcha atee'e sodaantaashshaten.<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />«Atike arda Isira'eelite kadebaak, yaane kinni atike summike lummeninaa'n kexxeexxa bayyike boganaa'n degeeki alagi manji hedhoole; <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />bayyii'n manni daga'nechchi summa atika lumoka, jabaxxa atixxa anga, atixxe qeerraaxxe hirrexxa laqeete kaddemmaxxee iikki manji dage'e konne galmiba soodatoole, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />ati galduma atike'ni iima hexxe laqqe'e ate'e qoreexxa duuchcha isi'a muuxxi; tinninna buttatik arduwwi duuchchi summa atika ege'neexxi, ardi atik Isira'eel atee'e sodaatammasha insa'nenna atee'e sodaanto'anna ani ijaarenneki kunni mini summi atik ye'ema'neeke kadeexxa egennaashshaten.<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />«Atik ardi naapha ifika lolo'a ergitattoke fedheeke boonchiba'a bagedoke'e fulaa wodda, ati fi'litetteke qachchiba'anna ani atike summi'a ijaarenneke galmibaa'a wirr hiyye Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa soodatoole, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />Soodachchotanna kadha insixxa iimate'ni hexxe laqqe'e gargaar.<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />«Cubbo hujabaaki manji hedhebaan; tennexxe'e ardi atiki cubbo hujeexxi atee'e yaadisse'na'a, atinna mufatte naaphi bayyike yookaan shiqike ifike bogibaa booji'e adhdhe me'aashsha anga isixxe'n sa'issite arda atika uutottole; <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />ardi booji'eme hedheeke ookkone boga'ni hedheexxi ‹Cubbo hunjeennen; balleessinennen; fuggoxxanna assineen› hiyya'n aadde aage ate'e kadhatoole; <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />Iittann insa'ne booji'e adhdheeke naaphinke boga'ni he'ne mitte godobininna shenitte hedhon atiba hingoole, annuwwa insa'neeke'e uutetteke konne bogiba'a, fi'litetteke konne qachchiba'anna summa atike'e ani ijaarenneke galmiba wirri hine ate'e soodantoole; <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />Iima galduma atikenaa'n soodachcho insa'neexxanna kadha insa'neexxa laqi, insa'nenna qarqqar. <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />Ate'ni hunjeexxe cubboxxeenna ate'e balleessineexxe sa'ne duuchchi'a arda atikee gattowaal hiyyi; insa'ne booji'eekir insa'ne'a o'wwaashsha assi; <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />insa'neqa ati siblijo baqisaaxxe itoonixxe giirashsha hedheeke Gibtseke boginaa'n fulchitetteke atike arda.<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />«Ta'anna ille atixxi erganjo atikixxenna arda atike Isira'eelixxe kadhabaa'a baqqi hiteexxe kaddowwaal; ardi atik atibaa oodha wodda duuchchanna oodhishsha insixxa laqi. <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Ee dada duuchchike Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa annuwwa no'oka Gibtseke boganaa'ni fulchitetta wodda Muuse'e atike erganji darree'n haasootettashshanni insa'ne atike geego kandaasha gosa gosake arduwwi duuchchanaa'ni insa'ne'e gargara foote'eteken.»<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Solomooninna tenne soodachchonna kadhaa duuchcha Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa shiqilsheechchi uduma anga ifixxa iimi'a farri asseexxi guluffate hedhemabaa'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottike tolchimalchi edii'ni ke'e. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Ookkoneechchi udumi'a uurreexxi Isira'eelixxe tuuta duuchchi edo hafuura gikki asse hiyye eebbisee qici:<verse eid="1KI 8:55" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />«Haaso'emmaxxe addachchiiseshshanni arda ifika Isira'eeli'i hafuura adhdhiseeka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta galati geyowwaal; erganjo ifike Muuse darree'n haaso'emmake eloxxe addachchiisa duuchchanaa'n mitti hiyyichchinna midde gatebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:10">Lan. 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 21:44-45">Iya. 21:44-45</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'oki Magen edike no'oke annuwwinni welti hedhemmashshanni no'onninna hedhowwaal; no'o waaloqqe'e, hunoqqe'e. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />Isika ora duuchcha me'inonna'a, edike no'oke annuwwi'a uwwemmaka ajajuwwa, seeruwwanna galdumuwwa heqqe'nannoshsha qalbe no'oxxa ifiba'a wirri assowwaal. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Barra barra'ninn ane'e erganjo isikixxanna arda ifike, Isira'eelixxa halcha muuxaashsha tinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo soodatennexxi anxi soodachcho, hashsha barra Duuchchi Woddike Gootta no'oke Magen edo shiqqaaxxe kaddowwaal. <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />Tinninna butta duuchchi arduwwi, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti, Magenoke kadeexxa, isi gadhi darre weli hedhebaaxxa ege'naashshaten. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Tennexxee techchixex tenne barrashshsha, seera isike'n galdinoanna ajaja isika heqqexxino'a qalbe ha'nooxxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'nooke Mageni'a hirendeexxe kaddowwaal.»<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galmiinxa Eebba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 7:4-10">2 Odo. 7:4-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanjikinna isinni welti hedhemmak Isira'eelik manni duuchchi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo tolcha shiqishe. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Solomoon mittoomiinke tolchi'a lame tommenna lame kuma laliinxa kormoole, dhibbanna lame tomme kuma gedhebonna re'e, Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishe; konne qicinni moyanjikinna Isira'eelik ardi manni duuchchi Duuchchi Woddike Goottika galma eebbinse.<verse eid="1KI 8:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Eettene barra'ninni moyanji Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmi edo hedheeke ba'liniinxa odditte bakka Magenokee foyendeexxe kaddaashsha asseexxi, ookko ciincatika tolcha, midhatika tolchanna mittoomiinke tolchixxa ha'yo, shiqishe; tenne'e asselchinna, Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo hedheek sageetotike sibiljik tolchimalchi shiixxedhatenaa'n kexxeexxa ciincatika tolcha, midhatika tolchanna mittoominke tolchika ha'yo dande'e aadha gophemmaxxeetten.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Ookkone wodda Solomoon isinni welti hedheeke Isira'eelike manni duuchchinni welti, kunninna Hamati e'yinammabaa'n Gibtseke bagoke lagi qico'n hedheeke boga duuchchanaa'n bukki hiteexxe lumoxxe tuutanni welti ayyaana ayyaaneeffate; Insa'nenna torbaane barra, higgeenni wele torbaane barra mitteba tommenna shoole barra Duuchchi Woddike Gootta no'oke Mageni edo ayyaana ayyaneeffante.<verse eid="1KI 8:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Isinna itti aandaaxxe barra'n arda geegesse; ardinna moyanjo eebbise. Duuchchi Woddik Gootti erganjo ifike Daawwiti'anna arda ifike Isira'eeli'a asseexxe eloxxe duuchchixxe ardi mitte godobinni gammade ililliseexxi ifi ifike miniba'anna illeema hige me'e.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Solomooni'a Higgeen Leele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 7:11-22">2 Odo. 7:11-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Solomoon Duuchchi Woddike Goottika galmanna ifixxa mootummatika mine ijaadhdhe bireechchi udumanna hujo'a haseexxa duuchcha muuxeechchi uduma, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Geba'oonii'n Solomooni'a leellemmashshann higgeen iso'ni leelle.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:5">1 Moy. 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:7">2 Odo. 1:7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti isoo hiyyee qici, «Ani edo soodattettexxa soodachchonna kadha laqeenneni; konnee ijaartettaka galma summi anki ookko'o duuchchi wodda'a hedhaashsha asse qulloonse foyeennen; ille anxinna godobi anki duuchchin wodda ookko'o hedhaan.<verse eid="1KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />«Atinna atik anni Daawwiti assemmashann qajelummatinna addatenshat me'itettele ani ajajennexxa duuchcha muuxxottole; seera ankanna ajaja heqqexxottole; <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />Anna atike Daawwiti'a, ‹Isira'eelixxe moote'ni ofo'laaka manjo sanne atixxenaa'n gophaboxxon› hiyye haaso'ennaxxe addeeshshann moote atixxi Isira'eli'ni duuchchi woddi'a jabaatte hexxaashsha assannon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">1 Moy. 2:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />«Yaane kinni ati yookaan oose atixxi anee gibbine'e udumi'a higgnoole; ha'no'a uwwenneka ajajuwwanna seeruwwa heqqedhaa gophphinoole; me'itine wele magenuwwa magenoonfatinaa'n isi'a kumbu hitinoole, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />Aninna Isira'eeli'a uwwennake boganaa'n shorraannoni; summa ankee hiyye woyyoonsenneka konne galma waalannoni; ookkoneechchi uduma Isra'eel arda duuchcha'n osolendeexxenna mammaakendeexxe kaddaani; <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Kunni galm mambe'a hinaake kadooleenna midde; oletixxe tuulo kadaani; ookko'n sa'aaki duuchchi manciira hiyyani; oso'la'nina ‹Duuchchi Woddik Gootti konne boga'ninna konne galma'n itta hexxeexxa yaane asseechchi mayye'ate?› hiyyaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:9">2 Moy. 25:9</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:19">2 Odo. 36:19</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Iikki manninna hiyyaa qici, ‹Eeti Duuchchi Woddik Gootti tennee elobaaxxa duuchcha insa'ne'ni iyyedageechchi Annuwwa insa'neeka Gibtseke boganaa'n fulchemmaka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Mageno insa'neeka waaleexxi wele magenuwwa sagandexxeenna iso magenoofantemmaxxeeteni› » hinaani.<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomooni Wele Hujeexxa Hujuwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 8:1-2">2 Odo. 8:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Solomoon lamiinga kinjiinka minuwwa, Duuchchi Woddike Goottika galmanna moyatika mine huje bireexxe lame tomme woggake muuxama'n; <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />Moyanji Solomoon Geliila hedheeka lame tomme qachchuwwa Xiroosike moyanji'a Kiraami'a uwwe; moyanji tenne asseechchinna, hasisaachcho duuchcha biribriisa, hi'nessakanna worqe Kiraami uwwemmaxxeeteni; <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Kaddo malee'e Kiraami Xiroosii'n ke'e Solomoon uwwe'eka qachchuwwa uudo'a maree wodda ookkone qachchuwwa'n gammadebaan. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Isinna, «Anke dayyo; kunni ani'a uutettek qachchuwwi mayiinke?» hiyye. Konnee qachchuwwanna «Kabuulike<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kebuul </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyaak Ibritotike hiyychchi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Eloxxe yaaneke mammaassa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyaake Ibritotike hiyyichchinni welti weli aagaake ye'injo afeedheen.</char></note> boga» hiyye. Kunni qachchuwwi telchi qico'n konne summinni ye'ema'neen. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Ookkone wodda Kiraami moyanjoke'e shoole kuma kiilo giraami qica worqe ergeemman.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomoon Hujeexxa Wele Hujuwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 8:3-18">2 Odo. 8:3-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Moyanji Solomoon Duuchchi Woddike Goottika galma, ifika mootummatika mine, Milooni'i<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miloon hiyya Ibritotike laagadinni akimagaada wonshate hiyyate kadda wodda yookaan kiphphaaxxe gimo hiyyeemanna kadda </char></note>, Iyyerusaalemika dalla'a, Hatsoori'i, Megidonna Geezeri'i ijaarate'e hunnatixxa huje hujaaka manna file'emman; <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />Gibtsek mayanji Feri'oon Geezerika qachcha lole miidheexxi giddo hedheemaxxa Kenaanito shiye'e qachchakanna gubeeexxi abixxe; ookkoneechchi uduma belto ifixxa Solomooni'n heerunsiisee wodda Gezeriinika qachcha gice ise'a uwwe. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Solomooninna Geezerii'i hiisse ijaare; ittanni aadi darrexxa Beetihoroninna ijaare, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />Ba'ilati, Yihudaxxe qiilla gammoojje'n hexxeexxa Taamirii'i ijaare; <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />Solomooninna masscecatika qachchuwwa, fadhadiinxi gaaruwwa heqqemmaka qachchuwwa iittann fadhado gulufammak manni hedhaka qachchuwwa ijaare; ittanni Iyyerusaalemi'ni, Libaanoosi'ninna wele isi galchammake boga duuchcha'ni ijaaro'a haseechcho duuchcha ijaare.<verse eid="1KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Isira'eelike arda kadebaaka Amoorak, Hiititotik, Feeriizito, Hiwaatonna Iyyaabusak ardi duuchchi giddii'n gate'eka <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />Isira'eelki ardi sanne insa'neexxa balleessate'e dandeennebaakanna bogake'n gateekaara konneera telchonna assinammashshann Solomoon hunnatixxe huje'a insa'ne file. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Kaddo malee'e Solomoon Isira'eelike manni giddii'n garba assebaan; insa'ne loliink manni, ja'laabuwwi, loliinke mannik ajajalluwwi, lolake'e ajajammakir, loliinke manniki jaliqabuwwi gaaruwwa oofaakeeramman. <verse eid="1KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Kunnirinna Solomoon hujisammaka kinjinke minika ijaarsa hujaake mannika hujalluwwa towataakeramman; laakkoossi insa'neekinna 550.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Feri'oonixxi belto Daawwitike qachchanna'ni Solomoon ise'a hujiseeke mootetike miniba'a daggeechchi uduma Solomoon Milooni ijaare.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Solomooninna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a hujisemmake tolchin boonchcho'n woggate'ni sasele ciincatika tolchanna mittoomiinka tolcha shiqisheexxi; konneninn welit Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo hixaana guba'nemman; konne qicin galma ijaare bire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:17">Fula. 23:17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:23">34:23</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:16">Lew. 16:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Iittanni moyanji Solomoon Eedoomike boga'n, Eelaati bira, Diimmoxxe Abbaayya qarqara'n hexxexxe Etsiyonigabiiri'n hoboluwwa giisse. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Hoboluwwate'n hana Solomoonike mannini welti hunjo'a; Kiraami abbaayyate'n hunja qico ege'neeka ifika hoboluwwatika manna erge. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Insa'neenna Ofiirike bogibaa mareexxi tommenna shoole kuma kiilo graama worqe aa'ne dangeexxi moyanjo Solomooni'a uune.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Saabaxxi Mootitte Solomoon'i Uuddo'a Marteexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Odo. 9:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Saabaxxi mootitte Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summi'a ulfinna idaga'neeka Solomoonika gurra laqqe wodda mekki assaake qortumin iso'o hega uudo'a dagge. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Lumoka manna duuka hordofiseexxi shitto, yo'oxxa worqenna hiri fiixxeka kinjuwwa gaalaken fe'iseexxi Iyyerusaalemi'i galteechi uduma Solomoonibaa marteexxi godoba affe'eka yaada duuchcha iso'n shiqishshe. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Solomooninna laqqeexxa duuchcha ise'a hiisse; moyanji hiissa gophee'na gateek mitti qortuminna hedhebaan. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Saabaxxi mootitte Solomoonika beekkuma; ijaareemmaxxa mooteti mine uuddaa wodda, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />Ittanni isixxe qortten shiqqaaxxa ita; ja'laabuwwi ofo'leexxa; ergatemammak aadatixxe seemmanninn, bulbulo ibisammakara, ittanni Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmiba shiqisheeka ciincatika tolcha uudda wodda hara yo'oshsha mambe'a hite.<verse eid="1KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Isenna moyanjo hitee qici, «Muuxxettexxe hujexxeenna beekkuma atike'e boga aninge'ni hedhenne wodda laqenexxi dhugaaten. <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Kaddo malee'e ani umi aniniginnini dagee'e konneechchuwwa illeti uudannoxxee addateennabaan; dhugaandinni gamisa midde ane'ni kulle'ebaan; beekkumi atikinna durumma atixxi laqene iimi darren. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Atike mannixxa wodo! Duuchchi wodda ati edo uurrneexxi beekkuma atika laqa'neer ja'laabuwwiinxa wodo! <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />Ate'n gammade Isira'eelixe moote'ni ate'e ofo'lisheek Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Magen saademowwal; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti duuchchi woddixxe isixxe jaalalanni Isira'eel'i eeyyatenaa'ni kexxeexxa; dhugaatixxi murtenna qullumma bira saxxaashsha atee'e moyanjoke asse'en» hite.<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Moyanjoke'e shoole kuma kiilo worqe xe'maxxa shuutta shufruwwanna fiixe'eka kinjo isi'a uute; Saabaxxi mootitte moyanjo Solomooni'a uutemmaxxe qiciixxa bira saxxeexxa xe'maxxa shuuta shufuruwwa ookkoneechchi uduma hara uwweeki hedhebaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:42">Mat. 12:42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:31">Luq. 11:31</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />Iittann Ofiiri'n worqe iyyedageexxi Kiraamixxi hoboluwwa yo'oxxa sandaletixxa haqqenna fiixxeeka kinjuwwa iyyedage. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Moyanjikinna sandaletixxa haqqe Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmixxe kipha'anna moyatike minixxe kipha'a, faarsaleeyyete'e kiraarakanna masinqo giisinaashsha asse. Konne qico bira saxxeexxi sandaletixxi haqqe telchi qico'n hara iyyedange'na uunde egennebaani.<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Moyanji Solomoon Saabaxxi mootitte badhaase ise'a uwweechchi gadho hasseexxanna laqeexxa duuchcha ise'a uwwe; ookko'ni isenni dagemmake manninni welti ifike bogiba higge.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomoonxa Durumanna Ulfinna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:13-29">2 Odo. 9:13-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Solomoon wogga wogga'n alfammaxxi worqe lame tommenna sase kuma kiilo qicammani. <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />Tinninna daddalaakenaa'ni wele orinn isi'a uunaammaki qaraxi; Arabiinki moyanjuwwi duuchchi bukki asse uwwaammakanna boga galchaammak manni bukki assemmaxxi irbo lebendebangiten.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Moyanji Solomoon bexxi assineexxe worqen lame dhibba lumolla wonte hujise; mitti mittinxe wonte'n mankeexxi worqe torbaane kiilonna gamisa worqemman. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />Ittanni bexxi assine'exxe worqen sase dhibba shiixxaramma wonte giissise; mitte mitte wonte'nini mankeexxi worqe lame kiilo geltaaxxemman. Moyanji kinna tennee Libaanoosike gongoma hinaake mootummatike mine'n ugge.<verse eid="1KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanji Aribiinxe issooni lumoxxa moote gissiseexxi ca'itte woriqenni buure. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Mootetinna jaane koobbo affeemman; udumi darree'ni iima guutote'ni kuku'mitte kaddaa wodda; middanna bita'a irkantaachcho afe'en; irkantaachchi bira lami Neenqi uurre'en. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Jaaninixxe koobbo'n hana middi'ni jaani bita'i'ni jaani Neenqi uurre'en. Tennee fakkaattaxxi moote hoone galchatike boga'ninna hara hujende egendebaan. <verse eid="1KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Moyanji Solomoon ha'wa'neexxi buuda duuchcha worqeti giissineexxe kadda woddaa; Libaanoosike gongoma hiyyemaake mooyatike mini giddo hedheek miyi duuchchi ca'itte worqenn hujeme'ekemman; Solomoon galchammake baro'ni sibiljo birre la'o afeeshsha udema gophphaammaxxe sibiljo birrenn hujeme'ek miyi ijje hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Moyanji Kiraamixxe hoboluwanni welti Abbayyate'ni me'inaaka Terseesixxa daddalatixxa hoboluwwa afeemman. Kunnichuwwi sase sase wogga giddo mittele worqe, sibljo birrenna Arbiinxa isso, Qamaletanna buraburrite ci'a idanga'nemman.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Moyanji Solomooninna durummatinna beekkumik boga duuchcha'n hedheeke moyanjuwwi irra sa'emman. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Butta duuchcha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Solomoonixxe qalbe'ni ugge'eka beekkuma isiba dage laqatee'e halchinaamman. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Wogga wogga'ninni daga'neeka manjo duuchcha sibiljo birrenna worqetik miyi, seemma, loliinka miya, shitto, fadhadokanna gaange konneechchuwwa uune badhaansaamman.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Solomoon fadhadiinxa gaaruwwanna fadhado bukki asse; mitte kumanna shoole dhibba fadhadiinxa gaaruwwanna tommenna lame kuma fadhaduwwa afe'emmaan. Konneechchuwwa duuchcha fadhadiinxi gaaruwwa hexxeeka qachchuwwanna isi hedhaammabba Iyyerusaalemii'i he'naashsha asse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:26">1 Moy. 4:26</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Moyanji ifike galchati baro duuchcha'n Iyyerusaalemi giddo birreti sibljo kinotishsha, Birbirsiinxe haqqenna Yihudake tullichchuwwi hunda habanna latamake odi'ishsha lakko'endaammanna. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Solomooni'a fadhado idangeek Gibtsee'inna Qewwee'nite kadaa wodda; konneera Qewwe'ni hirte dageexxi mootummatike minxe isixxe daddaltomman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:16">Lew. 17:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Mitte fadhaadinxa gaare Gibtsee'ni hirre danga'neek jaane dhibba birretik sibiljo kada wodda; fadhado kinn mitte dhibbanna onde tomme sibiljo birren hirre dangaamman; Hiititotenna Sooriyake moyanjuwi'a idange'e insa'ne'n gurgurraamman.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">Solomoonixxa Aruwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Moyanji Solomooni Feri'oonixxe belto gadho heddo wele bogixxa melaalle tinninna Mo'aabitotixxa, Amoonitotixxa, Eedoomitotixxa, Sidoonitotixxa, Hiititotixxa melaalle eeyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:17">Lan. 17:17</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />Insa'nenna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti Isira'eeli'i, «Qalbe ha'nooxxa insa'neeke magenuwwiba dhugaadinn hiise'naammaxxe'e insa'neexxa dubarte aadha ha'no'a hasissabaan» hiyye. Hiyyemmake gosa gosake ardi darre'ni he'nemman; kaddo malee'e Solomoon kinni, insa'nenni weli jaalalati jammi hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:16">Fula. 34:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:3-4">Lew. 7:3-4</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />Isinna moyanjuwwakenaa'n ilendeexxa torbaane dhibba aruwwanna sase dhibba gursume'a aadheemman; aruwwatinna qalbe isixxi weleba daaqqaashsha assite. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Solomoon cimee wodda aruwwa isixxi wele magenuwwa magenoonfataashsha assite; ann isiki Daawwiti mitte godobinni ajajjememmashsha Solomoon mittte godobinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ajajjemebaani. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Solomooninna Sidoonitotixxe melaalleka mageno asitaarooti, batto'eeke Amoonitotika mageno Milkoomiii'i magenoonfate. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Tennexxee Solomoon Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo fuggoxxa yaane asse; anna isike Daawwitishsha Duuchchi Woddika Gootta muuxamin qico'n hordofebaani.<verse eid="1KI 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Solomoon Iyyerusaalemii'n boroti darree'n hexxeexxe kooba'n batto'eeke Mo'aabitotike mageni'a Kemooshi'a, iittaanni batto'eeke Amoonitotike mageno Moloki'a magenoonfantaaka tullichcha giisse. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Magenuwwa insa'neeke hixaana guphphitaaxxenna tolcha shiqilshitaaxxe wele aruwwa ifixxe duuchchi'a konne qicinn insa'ne'a giisse.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />Solomoon lame yanna isi'a leellemmake Isira'eelike Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Magenonaa'n bayyatemmaxxe; Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti iso'n mufate. <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />Mittelchonna wele magenuwwa hordofabaashsha Solomooni'i hoyyoolenna midde; Solomoon Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ajaja heqqedhebaani. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Solomoonii'i hiyyee qici, «Tenne assitettaaxxe ati'a ajajennexxa kako anxanna seera anka heqqedha gophphettaxxe; mootumma atixxa atenaa'n hoyye'e eriganjuwwa atikenaa'n mittekee uwwannoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Tenne kinn anni atikixxe Daawwitixxee hiyyee baro atike'ni assabo'noni; mootumma atixxa lameba hiissannoki belti atikixxe anganaa'niteni. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Ittanna kaddoole mootumma duuchcha isonaa'n hoyyabo'noni; yaanne kinni anke eriganjixxe Daawwitixxennaa fi'lennaxxe Iyyerusaalemixxe hiyye'e belto atikee mitte gosa uwwannoni» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomoonika Naaphuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Edoomike moyanjuwwixxe gosanaa'n Eedoomichcho Hadaadi Solomooni'n naaphake asse ke'isse. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Ookkoneechchi edigama Daawwiti Eedoomike mannini welti lolemmamma wodda; reyeka manna moogo'a dageemmaki lolinke manniki ajajali Iyyo'abi Edoomika labballo duuchcha shiyee bireemmani. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Iyyo'aabinna Isira'eeliki loliinki mann duuchchi Eedoomika labballo duuchcha shinne birraa qico'n ookko'o jaane agenjo turreemmani. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Hadaadi kinni oosummadinni hedhe anna isikee ergatemeemmake heenoke Eedoomike manninni welti Gibtse'a baaje. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Insa'nenna Midiyaamii'n ke'neexxi Faaraani'a me'ine; Faraani'n manna adhdhineexxi Gibtse'a dangeexxi; Gibtseke moyanjiba'a Feri'ooniba marre. Moyanjikinna Hadaadi'a minekanna boga uwwe; itaachchonna uwwe hiyye ajaje.<verse eid="1KI 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Feri'ooninna Hadaadi yo'oshsha eeyye; tennexxee isixxe arexxa mootitte Xaafineesixxa dayyo iso'n aadhise. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Xaafineesixxi dayyonna Genbaati hinaaka labbaka belto isi'a ilde; mootitte Xaafineesi moyatike mine'n adhdhite nosseexxe; Genbaatinna Feri'oonixxe oosenni welti nophphe.<verse eid="1KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Hadaadi Gibtsen hedheemma wodda Daawwitiinna lolinka manna ajajammaki Iyyo'abi renneexxa laqe. Hadaadinna Feri'oonii'i «Bogi ankiba'a me'onna'a eetti ani'a uwwi» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Feri'ooninna, «Kaba ati'a maachcho xe'ye'naate bogi atikiba'a me'atee hassettelchi?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:22">Hadaadinna, «Mittilchi xe'yeechchi hedhebaani; me'onaa'a calla eetti an'a uwwi» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Higgeenna Mageni Rezooni hiyyemaaka Eli'aadanika belto Solomooni'n naaphake asse ke'isse; Rezooni Tsobake moyaanjonaa'n gootta ifike Hadaai'ezerina'n finqileemmakemmani. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />Daawwiti Subaanika loliinka manna shiye bireechchi uduma Rezooni manna qarqara ifike'n bukki assedheexxi finqileemmake mannike akeekisanjo kade; Rezoonina ifike manninni Demasiqo'a me'e ofo'le; okko'o iso'o moyanjoke assine. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Hadaadi geessiseexxe rakko gadho Rezooni Solomoonike baro duuchcha'n Isira'eelike naapha kade; Rezooni Sooriyake moyanjo kade; Isira'eelixxa ijje giba'nemmani.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoribi'ami Solomooni'n Fuggoxxinni Ke'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Ittaanni Solomoonike ja'labuwwanaa'n mitti Naabaaxik belti Iyyorbi'aami moyanjoke'n fuggoxxinni ke'e; isinna Tsereeda hiyyemaake boganaa'n dageeke Efireemixxe sanne kadaa wodda; ama isixxinna Tsuri'a hiyyendaaxxe aro'i reyexxe manjichchomani.<verse eid="1KI 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Isi moyanjoke'n fuggoxxinni ke'exxi buuto; Solomoon kiphake kaddaaxxa koobbuwwa giisa'n anni ifikike Daawwitike qachchika dalla'a qammachcha'nemmani. <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Iyyorbi'aaminna yo'oshsha ege'na afeeke dargaggeessa manjomani; Solomooninna kunni dargaggeessi elo qicinni huje huja'neexxa uudeexxa yanna Yooseefixxe gosa giddo hunja'neexxe hunnatixxe huje duuchchi'a umoke asse.<verse eid="1KI 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Eettene yannaa'n Iyyorbi'aami Iyyerusaalemii'n fulee me'a'neege'ni haarooka ejja oddo'week, Seeloo'ni dageek wabeek Akiya qachchii gadho isoo orake'n afe; <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Akiya oddo'wemmaka haarooka ejja adheexxi tommenna lameba daddare. <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Iyyorbi'aami hiyyee qici: «Tomme daremalcho ati ifi'a adhdhi; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eeliki Magen hiyya'nee qici: ‹Kunseteni mootumma Solomooninaa'n hoyye'e tomme gosa ati'a uuwwannoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Yaane kinni anke eriganjixxe Daawwitixxenna Isira'eelixxe gosa duuchchanaa'n fi'lennaxxe Iyyerusaalemike qachchixxe'e hiyye'e mitte gosa isi'a gatisannoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Tennee assaannelchi anee ginbeexxi Sidoonaka magenuwwa astaarooti, Mo'aabika magenuwwa kamooshi, Amoonitotika magenuwwa Milkoomii'i magenoofantemmaxxe ittaanni anni isiki Daawwiti assemmaashsha anke ora'n me'a gonpheemmaxxe ani edo eloxxa assa gonpheemmaxxe; galduma ankanna seera anka heqqedha gonphemmaxxeeteni.<verse eid="1KI 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />« ‹Kaddo male'e mootumma isixxa duuchcha isonaa'ni hoyyabo'non, tenneenna assaannek fi'lennakixxe seerakanna ajaja anka heqqedhemmaxxe'e anke erganjixxe Daawwitixxee hiyye hedhaake baro duuchcha'ni moyaashsha assannon. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Mootumma isixxa belto isikenaa'n adhdhannon; ati'anna tomme gosa uwwannon <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />Anki summi ye'emaashsha fi'lennaxxe eettene Iyyerusaalemike qachcha'n erganjo anke Daawwiti'a duuchchin wodda ani edo ifi hedhaasha belto isike'e mitte gosa uwwannon. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Atee kinni atee'e Isira'eelike moyanjo assannon; ati eettetteka boga duuchcha akeekkatton. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Erganji ank Daawwiti assemmashanni atinna ani ajajenneka ajaja anka duuchcha muuxxottole ora anke'n me'itottole seerakannaa ajaja anka heqqexxe toggitte yaane ani edo assitoottole atinni welti hedhannon; Dawwitixxa mootumma jabeessenneshshanni ati'aanna ittann duuchchin woddi'a hexxaaxxa mootumma jabeessannon; Isira'eelinna ati'a uwwannon. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa Daawwitika mine salphisannon; yaane kinni duuchchiin wodda'atebaan› » hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Solomooni Iyyorba'amii'i shiyatee hase, Iyyorbi'aaminna Gibtse'a baaje moyanjo Shishaaqiba mareexxi Solomoon reyaaqico'ni ookkooni ofo'le.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomoonixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:29-31">2 Odo. 9:29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Solomoon moyemmake baro'n asseexxinna hujeexxi duuchcha, beekkumi isikinna Solomoonixxe jirtetike maxaafa'ni borreesseme'eba? <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Solomoon Isira'eeli duuchcha'n Iyyerusaalemi'i moyeeki shoole tomme woggan. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Solomoon lummedhe anni ifikike Daawwitike qachcha'ni moonge; belti isik Roobi'aaminna isixxe bakka'ni moye.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s1">Isira'el Roobi'ami'ni Fuggoxxin Ke'e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 10:1-19">2 Odo. 10:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Isira'eeli duuchcha moosinso'a Sekemi'a me'inemmaxxe'e Roobi'aaminna ookko'an mare, <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Naabaaxik belti Iyyorbi'aami tennee laqe wodda moyanjo Solomoonii'i baaje hedhammake Gibtseke bogibaa'ni hige dage. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Tennexxee Iyyorbi'aamibaa ergine isinna Isira'eelik haagani duuchchi Roobi'aamibaa dangeexxi, <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />«Anni atik no'o'ni jabaxxa ba'o ba'iseen, ati kinni ta'a anni atikixxa mararte affebaaxxa galcha no'o'ni ba'isemmaxxa jabaxxa ba'o shollishshottole ati'a hiremmannon» hine.<verse eid="1KI 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Roobi'aminna, «Yoona me'e, sase barra uduma anibaa'a higgine dagge» hiyye. Tennexxee ardikinna me'e.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Roobi'aami anni isik Solomoon lubboti hedhemma wodda ergatendammaxxe geedhet welti mari'ate; «Konne ardi'a hiissichcho uwwonna'a ha'no ane'e maa hitina'ne?» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Insa'nenna, «Telcho ati konne ardi'a ergatendaatteke kaddottole, insa'ne'a ajajende gammachchiissaaxxa hiissa hiissitottole duuchchin wodda ati'a ergatemaake kandaan» hine.<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Roobi'ami kinni geedhe gorsiteeka gorsa tuffateexxi hiri'a isixxe kaddexxanna isi'a ergatendammaxxa dargageeyyuwwa, <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />«Ha'no ane'e gorsitino'a affine'ek yaadi maachcho? ‹Anni atiki no'o'ni ba'iseexxa ba'o no'onaa'ni shollishi› hiyya'neeke konne manni'a maa hine hiissinanno» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Dargaggeyyetinna hitee qici, « ‹Anni atiki jabaxxa ba'o no'o'ni ba'ise'en; ati kinni ba'o no'oxxa shollishi› hiyyeeke konne manni'a ‹Shuu'nichchi anki anike annike hidhi irra furdataan, <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />anni aniki jabaxxa ba'o ha'noo'ni fe'een; ani kinni isi caala saxxeexxe a'ursannon; anni anki halanget ha'no'o jadhafeen; ani kinn gaaddotishsha ha'no'o woxxaaxxe halangenn jadhafannon› insa'ne'a hiyyi!» hine.<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Moyanji kinna, «Sakka baro higgine dagge» insa'ne'e hiyyemmaxxe'e; Iyyorbi'aaminna ardi duuchchi sakka baro Roobi'aamibaa hinge dange. <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Moyanjinna geedhe uutemmaka gorsa waaleexxi, arda gammachchissabaaxxa hiissa hiisse. <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />Dargageeyye gorsitemmaka gorsa a'leexxi, «Anni anki qabbara ha'noo'ni ha'urse ani kinn isi caala qanbra ha'no'n ha'ursanon; anni anki halangeti ha'no'o jadhafeen, ani kinn gaaddotishsha ha'no idditaaxxe halangen ha'no'o jadhafannon» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Seeloke bogike Akiya darree'ni Naabaaxike beltixxe'e Iyyorbi'aamixxee haaso'e edi darre dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti mureexxe kaddemmaxxe'e, silaa muuxa hassisammaxxe'e moyanji ardi hiyyeexxa laqebaan.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Isira'eel duuchcha moyanji insa'neeka yaada laqa gibeexxa insa'ne egenneexxi, moyanjoke hine hiissinee haasonee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">«No'o Daawwitii'ni maa qoobo anfeenne?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">Isseyike beltonaa'ni maachcho alfinannochcho hedhee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Tee Isira'eel, ifi ifinxe duunkaanbaa higi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">Koo Daawwiti yoona ifinga mine heqqedhe!» hine hiissine.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1KI 12:16">Tennexxee Isira'eelik ardi ifi ifinge duunkaanbaa hige.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:1">2 Sam. 20:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Roobi'aaminna Yihudake boga'ni hedha'neeke Isira'eelike arda'n moyanjo kade. <verse eid="1KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Moyanji Roobi'aami hunnatixxa huje hujammake mannike akeekisanjo kadeemmaka Adooniraamii'i erge; yaane kinni Isira'eelik ardi duuchchi kinjik cancaqe iso'o shiye. Moyanji Roobi'ami kinni kadeenxa kade fadhadiinxe gaare'n gulufe Iyyerusaalemi'a baaje. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Eettene yannanaa'ni saffe'e middi darrexxi kuta Isira'eeli hiyyende summa Daawwitixxe sanne'n jalleeshshanni hedheen.<verse eid="1KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Iyyorbi'aami higeexxa Isira'eelik ardi duuchchi laqee wodda, yaa'a insa'neekiba'a ye'inse Isira'eelike boga duuchcha'n iso'o moosinse. Daawwitike mini'a xuurameesummati jaabaate hexxeexxi Yihudaxxe gosa callan.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shammaayya Haaso'eexxa Raaga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 11:1-4">2 Odo. 11:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Roobi'ami Iyyerusaalemi'i geyee wodda Isira'eelixxi gosa lolide mootumma Solomoonike belto Roobi'aami'a hiissinaashsha Yihudaki minninna Biiniyaamixxa gosa bukki asse; sannachchi laakkoossinna mitte dhibbanna saddeeta tomme kumamman.<verse eid="1KI 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Yaane kinn Mageniink hiyyichchi Mageniinke manjo kade'eke Saamayabaa dageexxi: <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />«Yihudike moyanjo Solomoonike belto Roobi'aami'a, Yihudake mine duuchchi'anna Biiniyaamixxe gosa'a ittanni gateeke ardi duuchchi'a hitatto qici, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />‹Dad duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici: tinni yaane ani darree'ni kaddeexxen; dayyuwwa ha'nooka Isira'eel'i loldinoqqe; ha'no mittimiting ifi ifike miniba higge› » tennexxe insa'ne dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajemmashshanni dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottika hiyyichcho lanqe ifi ifike minibaanna hinge.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Beeteli'inna Daani'ni Uurriteexxa Worqetixxa Jabbuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Ookko'ne Iyyorbi'aami tullichuwwiinke Efireemike boga'n hexxeexxa Sekemi'ni kollo giissedhe ookko'o ofo'le. Higgeenna ookko'ni ke'eexxi Phini'eeli kollo giissedhe.<verse eid="1KI 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Iyyorbi'aami godobik hiyye hedeeqic, «Mootumma Daawwitixxe sannebaa higgaaxxe labbaan <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />kunni ardi tolcha shiqishatee'e Iyyerusaalemi hedheeke dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmibaa me'a'noole higgeen qalbe gootta Yihudaka moyanjo Roobi'amiba'a hiisedho'aten. Ookko'ni aneenna shiyaani moyanjo Roobi'aamibanna higaan» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />Moyanji iso'o gorseechchi uduma lame worqetixxa jabbe giissisexxi arda hiyyee qici, «Tee Isira'eel ta'iqico Iyyerusaalemi'a martette qici geyaani Gibtseke boginaa'ni ate'e fulcheemmak magenuwwi kaba hedheen» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:4">Fula. 32:4</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Mitte Beeti'eeli'ni wele Daani'i uurrise. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Tinninna cubbote kadde; ardikinna ookko'o hedheeke kumbu hiyyo'a Daani qico'ni bayyate me'e. <verse eid="1KI 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Iyyorbi'aami magenoonfachchotike tullichchuwwa'n fukkuwwa giisexxi Leewwixxe gosa kadebaanga ardi giddii'n qeesete asse hariire. <verse eid="1KI 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Iyyorbi'aami Yihuda giddo assemaak ayyaanishanni saddeetike agenjo'ni tommenna ondixxe barra'ni ayyaana ulfeessinaasha mure; worqeti hujiseemake fakkuwwa'a Beeti'eeli hedheeke tolchimalchoke'ni ciinca shiqishe. Ookkonna Beeti'eelii'i magenoonfachchotee'e giisisseexxe tullichchuwwa'ni ergatendaaxxa qeese ugge. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Umi isinginninni fi'leeke saddeetike agenjo'ni tommenna ondixxe barra'n Beeti'eeli'i uurriseemmaxxe tolchimalcho'ni tolcha shiqishe; tennexxee Isira'eelike ardi'a ayyaana ulfeessinaashsha asse; isinna tolchimalchiinbaa mareexxi hixaana shiqishe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:33-34">Lew. 23:33-34</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yihudii'ni Dageeka Mageniinka Manjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Iyyorbi'aami tolcha shiqilshatee'e tolchini bira uurree'na dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottike hiyyichchi'a ajajemeexxi mitti Mageniink manji Yihuda'ni Beeti'eeli'a dage. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Tolchimalchokanna dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottike hiyyichchi gibati hiyyee qici, «Koo tolchimalcho dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, ‹kunse Iyyosiyaasi hiyyemaak Daawwitixxe gosa'a ilemaani isinna ta'aa kaba tolcha shiqisha'neekaara tullichchuwwake'ni magenoonfattamaxxa qeese ate'ni hana tolchaan; manniinxi miqenna ate'ni hana ha'yitaan› » hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:15-16">2 Moy. 23:15-16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Eettenee barra iikki Mageniinki manji beessisa hiyye uwwee qici, «Dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti uwwek beessisi, ‹Kunse, tolchimalchi hacaqqi hiyyaan hana hedhemmak bululinna dunemaan› » hitaaxxen.<verse eid="1KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Moyanji Iyyorbi'aami iikki Mageniink manji Beetelike tolchimalchoke'ni canca'ni haaso'eexxa laqe anga ifixxa tolchimalchoke'ni ke'isseexxi, «Isoo abidde!» hiyye. Yaane kinni iitti ke'issemmaxxi anga soorte gatte; bukki assanna dande'ebaan. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Ittanni iikki mageniink manji dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Gootta no'oke Magenike hiyyichcho'ni akeekeme uwwemmake beessisishanni tolchimalchi hacaqqi hiyye; bululikinna duneme.<verse eid="1KI 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Ookkoo'ni moyanji kinna Mageniinka manjo, «Anga anxa fayyiso'a dada duuchchika Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atika Mageno kadhati; ani'a soodati» hiyye; Tennexxe Mageniink manji dada duuchchik Duuchchika Woddika Gootta kadhate; moyanjiinxi angana fayyite; edi woddiba higge.<verse eid="1KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Moyanji kinna Mageniinka manjo, «Amo weyi afo'o uggu'litatton aniba mine marro; uwwatanna ati'a uwwannon» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Mageniink manji kinni moyanjo hiyyee qici, «Horattettelchonaa'n gamisakanna midde uutettele atinni welti me'abo'non; konno'o waasakanna itabo'non, wode'ekanna ha'wabo'noni. <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />Dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottike hiyyichchon, ‹Waasakanna ittoxxe, wode'ekanna ha'witoxxe me'iteteka ora higgoxxe› hiyyaake ajaja ani'a uwweme'en» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Tennexxe'e dageeka ora waaleexxi welenga ora Beeteli'a hige.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Ookkone wodda Beeti'eeli'i hedha'neek mitti wabeek geerchi hedhemman; oose isixxinna daggeexxi eettene barra'ni Magenik manji ookko'o asseexxa duuchchanna moyanjo maa hiyyeexxa anna insa'neeke'n kulle. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Anni insa'neekinna, «Isinnii hoone ora hige?» hine insa'ne'e laqe oosetinna Yihudaa'n dageek Mageniink manji higeeka ora anna insa'neenge'n leellinshe. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Tennexxe oosetanna, «Amme harichcho ani'a fe'we» hiyye. Insa'nenna harichcho feeneexxi hana gulunfe; <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />Gulufeexxi ookkonee'e Mageniink manjo hordofe. Ookko'n qilxi hunda ofo'lee'na uudeexxi, «Yihudaa'n daggettek Mageniink manji atetee?» hiyye laqe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:14">Isinna, «Eeti anenden» hiyye hiisse haaso'e. <verse eid="1KI 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Tennexxee iikki wabeek, «Welti mine marree'na ita ittotta'a ke'i» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Mageniinki manjinna hiyyee qici, «Udumi'a atinni welti hige'e me'abo'noni; konne booncho'ninna atinni welti ita itabo'noni; wodi'iinxa gadenna maqabo'noni. <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />‹Ookko'n ita itabonoshsha, wode'ekanna ha'wabo'noshsha, daggeetteka ora wirri hite higgaboxxoshsha› hiyye dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti anee ajaje'eni» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Iikki wabeek geerchi kinni, «Aninna atishanni wabeekaken; iimik Eriganji dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyyeeka hiyyichcho ane'n hiyyee qici, ‹Ite ha'wo'aa atike minibaa isoo hiissite iyyedagi› hiyye'neen» hiyye. Yaane kinni isi isoo sobeetemmani. <verse eid="1KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Tennexxe mageniinki manji isinn welti higeexxi mine isikenaa'n ite ha'we.<verse eid="1KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Itate'n he'ne'naa'a; dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hiyychchi wiri asse hiissemmake ookkone wabeek geerchibaa dage; <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />Yihudakenaa'n dagemmake Mageniinke manji'a; «Dda duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici, ‹dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottika hiyyichcho tuffatteetteni; dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atiki Magen ati'a uwweeka ajajuwwa heqqexxeboxxoni. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />Wirri hite higgettexxi ite ha'witaboxxoshsha hiyye kuleeke booncho'n ita itte'e; wodde'ekanna ha'witeteni. Tennexxe renshi atiki Annuwwi atiki moogememmake hireessa'n moogendaboxxoni› » hiyya'n canca'n isi'a haaso'e.<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Mageniinki manji ite ha'we ke'echchi uduma iikki wirri asse'e hiissemmaki wabeek ifika harrichchonna isi'a fe'e. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />Isinna me'ande'ni hedhe'naa neenqi orake'n shiye; renshi orake'n ibeemmaani; harichchotinna neenqi renshi bira uurineemmani. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Ookko'n sa'aammaki manni renshi orake'n ibee'na'a; neenqi bira uuree'na uundemmaxxe; iikki wabeek geerchi hedhemmake qachcha'n marre'e kaddeexxa haasoone.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Iikki orakenaa'n isoo hiissemmaki wabeek tenne laqeexxi, «Kunni manji dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottika hiyyichcho tuffateemmake Mageniinke manjoni; dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyye xexxe'achchiisemmashaani; sa'isse uuwee'naa neenqi ninnife shiyyeeni» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Ookkoneechchi uduma iikki wabeek oose ifixxa, «Harrichcho ani'a fe'we» hiyye; harrichchokanna feene. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Ookkoonna mareexxi renshi orake'n ibee'na harrichchotina neenqi bira uurrine'na afe; neenqikinna rensha iteemmabaani; harrichchotanna enqeemmabaani. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Tennexxee iikki wabeek ookkone Mageniinke manjika rensha aadheexxi harrete'n fe'e; oodhishiishe moogo'a ifike qachchibaa iyyedage. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Ookkoo'n rensha ifike hadike hirreessa'n mooge; «No'oke dayyo! No'oke dayyo!» hina'n isi'a oo'ne.<verse eid="1KI 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Moonge ke'neechchi uduma oose ifixxa hiyyee qici, «Ani reyanno wodda Mageniinki manji moogemeemmake hirreessa'n aneenna moogge; miqe anxanna isixxe miqe bira ugge. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Beeti'eel hedheeke tolchimalcho'n Semaariyake qachchuwwa'ninna tulluchuwwa'n hedheeke magenoonfanchotike boonchuwwa'n dada duuchchika Duuchchi Woddike Goottika hiyyichcho lallaba'ni laqiseeki hiyyichchi dhugaandinni muuxemaakeni» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Tinn duuchcha kadee'naani Iyyorbi'aami fuggoke oranaa'n higebaani; saxxexxini tulluchchuwwake'n magenoonfantammaba futti hiyyeenga harire qeesete assaammani; qeesete kado'a hasaaka duuchcha tulluchchuwwa magenoonfataammake'n qeesete asse hariira'nemmani. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Tinn cubbo Iyyorbi'aamixxi horte buttate'n hexxabaashshanna bakka baxxaashsha buutote kadde.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Akiya Iyyoribi'ami'a Haaso'eeka Raaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Eettene yanna'n Iyyorbi'aamik belti Abiya elagophe; <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />Iyyorbi'aaminna are ifixxa hiyyee qici, «Ke'i, Iyyorbi'amixxe are hine egennabaashsha ifi assite; Seelo'a me'i; konne arda'n moyannoshsha ane'n kuleeki wabeek Akiya ookko hedheeni. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Me'itatto wodda tomme wodhamo, heenooxxa daabbonna mitte odolcho malebo abixxite me'i; isinna beltoke'n kaddaaxxa ate'n kulaani» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Tennexxe Iyyorbi'aamixxi are isi hiyyeexxa assite Seelo hedheeke Akiyaba marte.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 14:4">Eettene yanna Akiya cimotenaa'n kexxeexxa ille garjeemmani. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Kaddo male'e Iyyorbi'aamixxi are ela gophpheeke iseke beltixxe qodhdhito'a ise ifi wele manjishsha assite daga'neexxanna maa hiyye ise'a haaso'aaxxa dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ediseexxi raagichcho Akiya'a kulemmaani.<verse eid="1KI 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Akiyanna ise hulatiba gelte'na hirba iseka laqeexxi ise'a hiyyee qici, «Tee Iyyorbi'aamixxe are mini'a e'yi; yaane kinni mayeete ifi wele manjoshsha assatee hassettelchi? Ati'a elobaaxxa odo ati'a kulonna'a ergemeenneni. <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />Ta'a martettexxi Iyyorbi'aami'i dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eeliki Mageni hiyya'neexxi hiyya hita'nee qici: ‹Ardi giddi'n ke'issennexxi Isra'eelike ardike akeekisanjo ate'e asseenneni. <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />Daawwitixxe sannenaa'n mootuma hoyyennexxi ati'a uwweenneni; ati kinni ani edo eloxxa calla assita'n ajaja anka heqqedhemmake mitte godobinni ane'e hordofemmake anke erganjo Daawwitishsha kaddeboxxoni. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />Ati edi darre hedhemmake duuchchi caala ati fuggoxxa hujjetteni; ifi'ani baqissetteke sibilinni wele magenuwwa giissite aneenna mufachchissetteni; dudduro ane'n wirri hitetteni.<verse eid="1KI 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />« ‹Tennexxe aninna Iyyorbi'aamike mine'n ba'ne geessisannoni. Garbichchokeenna kado'o ca'ichcha Iyyorbi'amika labbaka duuchcha Isira'eelinaa'n birannoni; hori gubate bululoke kadammashshaani; aninna Iyyorbi'amika mine iittanni gubannoni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:29">1 Moy. 15:29</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Iyyorbi'aamixxe hortenaa'n qachchi giddo reyaaka worishshi itaani; hadi giddo reyaaka kinni allaattuwwa ittaani. Tenne haaso'eeki dada duuchchike Duuchchi Woddike Goottani!›<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />«Yooni mini atikiba'a me'i. Hexxetteke qachcha'n e'yitetteshshani belti reyani. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Isira'eeli duuchchi isi'a ooxxa'n mooggaani. Dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eeliki Mageni Iyyorbi'aamike mine duuchchanaa'n gammade'eki iso'n calla kadeemmaxxee'e seeriki moogemaaki iso callani.<verse eid="1KI 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />«Tennee iimi darre, dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Iyyorbi'aamika mini hado biraaka moyanjo Isira'eeli'n ifi'anni techcho ke'issaani; tinninna kaddaaki ta'andeni. <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />Dad duuchchik Duuchchi Woddi Gootti Isira'eeli'i wodi'i giddo lele'maammake shonbooqishsha lele'misaani; Asheera hinaake magenuwwixxa fakke giissine dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddika Gootta mufachchiisseemmaxxee'e; dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti edike annuwa insa'neke uuwwemake konne eloke boganaa'n Isira'eelii'i shorraani; galaani widonna insa'ne xexxeeraani. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />Iyyorbi'aami cubbo hujeexxi Isira'eelinna cubbo hujjaashsha assemmaxxe dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Isra'eli hune waalaani.»<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Iyyorbi'aamixxi arenna kexxeexxi Tirtsa'a ifike minibaa me'iteeni. Mini'a e'yiteeshaani belti reyeeni. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti erganjo ifike wabeeka Akiya'n kulemmashshanni Isira'eeli duuchchi isi'a ooxxe mooge.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Wele Iyyorbi'aami asseexxe yaane duuchchi loleeka lolanna galcha isixxa duuchcha Isira'eelike moyanjuwwike raaginni borreesseme'eni. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Iyyorbi'aaminna lame tommenna lame woga moyeexxi reye; belti isiki Naadaabinna isixxe bakka'n moyye.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yihudinka Moyanjo Roobi'aami'i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 11:5-12:15">2 Odo. 11:5—12:15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Solomoonik belti Roobi'aami Yihudake'n moyee wodda wogga isixxi shoole tommenna mitte woggammani; isinna dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti summi isiki ye'emaashsha Isira'eelixxe gosa duuchchanaa'n fi'leexxi Iyyerusaalemi'n tommenna torbaane wogga moye. Ama isixxi Na'ima hiyyendaaxxe Amoonitotemmani.<verse eid="1KI 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Yihudak ardi dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo fuggoxxa yaane asse; edike annuwwi insa'neeki erra insa'ne hunjeexxi cubbo jabaxxa mufe mufataashsha assite. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />Iittanni mitte mitte tullichcha'ninna lumollamma haqquwwa hunda tullichchuwwake'n magenoonfantaaxxa fakkuwwa; Asheera hinaake magenuwwixxa fakke ifi'ani uurririssine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:9-10">2 Moy. 17:9-10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Tennenaa'n saxxeexxa fugguwwa magenoonfantammake mine'n yabaabulaaki mann ookkone boga'n hedhemmani; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eeli edi'n shorre fulcheemmaki gosa gosaki ardi hujammaxxa fuggoxxa huje duuchcha insa'neenna hunje.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:17">Lew. 23:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Roobi'aami moyeexxe saddeetixxe wogga'n Gibtsek moyanji Shishaaqi Iyyerusaalemi lole miidhe. <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />Dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottika galmanna moyatike minixxa karra adhdhe; Solomoon giissisemmaxxa woriqetixxa wontuwwa midde gattebaangi adhdhe me'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:16-17">1 Moy. 10:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:15-16">2 Odo. 9:15-16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Tennexxe moyanji Roobi'aami konneechcho bakkate'n hiisso'a sageettotixxa wonte giissiseexxi moyatike minxa hula heqqammaki heqqanjuwwiki akeekisanjuwwi ajajaashsha asse. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Moyanji dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmiba'a me'a wodda duuchcha heqanjuwwi wontuwwa edo abinda'nemmani; okko'n heqqanjjuwwiinxe kuta giddo hiissine uggina'nemmani.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Gattexxi Roobi'aamixxi galcha assexxi duuchcha Yihudake moyanjuwwixxe jirite'n borreessendeexxeba? <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Roobi'aamixxenna Iyyorbi'aamixxe oddo'n duuchchi wodda loli hedhemmani. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Roobi'aaminna reye; ediki annuwa mongemmake Daawwitike qachcha'n moonge. Ama isixxi Na'ima hiyyendaaxxe Amoonixxe gosammaani. Belti isiki Abiya isixxe bakkaa'n moye.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yihudiinka Moyanjo Abiyaa'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 13:1-14:1">2 Odo. 13:1—14:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Naabaaxik belti Iyyorbi'aami moyeexxe tommenna saddeeteessoxxe wogga'ni Abiya Yihuda'a moye. <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />Iyyerusaaleminni hedhe sase wogga galche; ama isixxi Ma'ika hiyyendaaxxe Abeseloomixxe beltomman <verse eid="1KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />Isinna anni isikishann cubbo huje; anna isike Daawwitishsha mitte godobinni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ajajemebaan. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Yaane kinni iso'n itti aane belti isik moyaashshana Iyyerusaalemi jabeesso'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni Daawwitixxee hiyye ifa uwwe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1 Moy. 11:36</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />Daawwiti Hiitichcho Ooriyo'ni hujeexxa balleessa malee; Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo dhugaatixxa yaane asse'en; lubboti hedhemmake baro duuchchaa'ni Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ajajana'n mishik asseexxi yanna hexxebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:1-27">2 Sam. 11:1-27</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Abiyanna lubboti hedhemmake baro duuchcha'n Roobi'aamixxenna Iyyorbi'aamixxe oddo'ni loli hedhemman. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Wele Abiya isike baro'n asseexxanna hujeexxa duuchcha Yihudake moyanjuwwixxe jirteti maxaafa'n borreessende hexxeexxebaa? Abiyaxenna Iyyorbi'aamixxe oddo'ni loli hedhemman. <verse eid="1KI 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Abiyanna reye; Daawwitike qachcha'n moonge. Belti isiki Aasa bakka isixxe'n moye.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yihudika Moyanjo Aasa'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 15:16-16:6">2 Odo. 15:16—16:6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Isira'eelik moyanji Iyyorbi'aami moyeexxe lame tomme wogga'ni Aasa Yihuda'n moye. <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />Iyyerusaalemi'ni shoole tommenna mitte wogga moye; akka'o isixxanna Ma'ika hiyyendaaxxe Abeseloomixxe beltomman.<verse eid="1KI 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Aasa anni isik Daawwiti assemmaxxa duuchcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo eloxxa asse.<verse eid="1KI 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />Moyanji Aasa fakkuwwa magenoonfatammake mine'n yabaabulaammaka duuchcha bogakenaa'n shorre; annuwwi isiki hujemmaxxa fakkuwwa duuchcha diige bire. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />Battoondeexxa Asheera hiyyendaaxxe meyyake magenixxa diqqachchisaaxxa fakke giisise uurisemmaxxee akka'o ifixxa Ma'ikaa'a mootittummatenaa'n hoyye; fakke isexxa butuche Qediroonixxe dhooqa'n gube. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Aasa magenoonfatammaka tullichuwwa hara balleesse bira gophoolenna midde lubboti hedhemmake baro duuchcha'n qalbeti Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a addatemeeke kade hedhemman. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Ann iskinna isi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a foneeka birretika sibiljonna worqe ittanni miyuwwa iyyedageexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmi giddo ugge.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Aasanna Isira'eelki moyanji Ba'isha insa'neeke mootummatike baro'n weli'anni weli lolema'ni he'nemmani. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Isira'eeliki moyanji Ba'isha Yihudake'n duule; ookko'n Yihudiinke moyanjo Aasake boga'n ayyinna e'yabaashshanna, ookkoo'ninna fulabaashsha hoyyatee Raamake boncho'n kollo giissedhe.<verse eid="1KI 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Aasanna Duuchchi Woddike Goottike mine'ninna moyatike minike miya massecatike mine'n gatemmaka birretika sibiljonna worqe duuchcha adhdhe; ookko'ninna xuurameesa kadeeke ifike ja'laabuwwixxe anga'n Demasiqo galchammake Xabirimoonika belto, Aaziinike beltike belto kadeeke Sooriyake moyanji'a Beenihadadi'a erge. <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />Aasanna hiyyee qici: «Anki anninna atiki anni welti aangemmashshanni; ta'anna atixxenna anxe oddo'n weli aaggo hexxowwaali; kunni birretika sibiljonna worqe ati'a ergenneni; ta'anna Isira'eeliki moyanji Ba'isha dagemmaba'a higo'a, isinni welti aaggeettaxxa kako diigi» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Benihaddadinna moyanjo Aasaka yaada adhdheexxi; loliinke mannika ajajlluwwa Isira'eelike qachchuwwa'n duulchisexxi Iyyoonii'i, Daani'i, Abeeli Beeti Ma'iikaninna Kinereeti duuchcha ittanni Nefitaalemininni welti Gensareexxi duuchcha lolle miine. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Moyanji Ba'ishanna tennee laqeexxi; Raama safeemmaxxa kollotixxa huje uurriseexxi Tirtsa'a hige. <verse eid="1KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanji Aasa mitti manji gataabaashsha Yihudake boga duuchcha'ni lassise; ookko'inna arda Ba'isha Raamake boga'ni uggemmaka haqichchonna haqqe gursiise; moyanjikinna konnooni Mitsiphaanna Biniyaamixxe galcha giddo hexxeexxa Geba'ineke qachchuwwa'ni kollo giissedhe.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Aasa moye galchamma sane'ni muuxeme'ek welichchi duuchchi; asseexxa duuchchanna hujee'eka qachchuwwa Yihudake moyanjuwwike jirtetike maxaafa'ni borreesseme hedhebaa? Moyanji Aasa cimee wodda kinni lekka dhibeme. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Aasanna reye, edik annuwwi moogeemeke hirreessa'ni anniinke Daawwitike qachcha'n moogeme; belti isik Iyyosafixxi bakka isixxe'ni moye.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelika Moyanjo Naadabi'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Yihudak moyanji Aasa moyemmake baro'ni; langaxxe wogga'ni Iyyorbi'aamik belti Naadaabi Isira'eel'i moye; lame wogga moye galche. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />Isinna anni ifiki me'eemmaka ora me'eexxi; anni hujee'exxa duuchchanna Isira'eeli hujjaashsha assemmaka cubbo hujati Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo elobaaxxa yaane huje.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Naadabinna Isira'eeli duuchchi Filisixeemike boga'ni hexxeexxa Gibetoonika qachcha bunqee'na; Yisakoorixxe sannenaa'ni ileme'eki Akiyaki belti Ba'isha fuggoxxinni ke'exxi Naadaabi Gebaatoni shiye. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Ba'isha Naababi'i shiyeechinna bakka isixxe'n moyeek, Yihudak moyanji Aasa moyeexxe sakkaxxe wogga'niten.<verse eid="1KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />Moyeeshanni iikki woddi Iyyorbi'aamika mini hado duuchcha shiye bire. Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Seelo ilemeeka erganjo Akiya gamii'ni haaso'emmashshanni Iyyorbi'amike mini hado mitte manjonna lubbo gatisebaang duuchchiinga bire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:10">1 Moy. 14:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />Tinninna kaddeechchi Iyyorbi'aami hujemaxxe cubbo'anna Isira'eelinna hujaashsha assemmaxxe buutonni, Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Isira'eelika Mageno mufachchiisseemmaxxeteeni.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Wele Naadaabi moyyemmake baro'n hujendeexxi; isi assexxi duuchchi Isira'eelike moyanjuwwixxi jirte borreessendemmake maxaafa'n borreesende hexxebaa? <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Aasanna Isira'eeliki moyanji Ba'isha moonemmake baro'n he'nemmaki weli'anni weli lollemma'ntemmaani.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelki Moyanji Ba'isha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Yihudak moyanji Aasa moyeexxe sakkaaxxe wogga'n Akiyaki belti Ba'isha Tirtsake qachcha'n; Isira'eeli duuchcha'n moye; lame tommenna shoole wogga moye galche. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Iyyorbi'aami me'emmanga ora me'ati Isira'eelina cubbo hujjaashsha assati Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo elobaaxxa asse.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Hanaanike belto raagichchi Iyyu daree'n Ba'ishaxxee Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hiyyichchi hiyyee qici: <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />«Ani atee'e bukotenaa'n ke'isse; anke ardike Isira'eelike akeekisanjo assenneni; ati kinni Iyyorbi'aamishsha kaddetteeni; cubbo hujje anee mufachchiissashsha anka arda Isra'eli dedhissetteni. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Tennexxee Ba'ishanna isika mini hado bakka balleessannoni; mine atikanna Naabaaxika belto Iyyorb'aamike minishsha assannoni. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Qachchi giddo reyaaka Ba'ishaxxa sanne duuchcha worshi itaani; hadi giddonna reyaaka duuchcha allaattete ittaani» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Ba'isha moyeemmake baro'n hujendeexxi; wele hujexxi huje duuchchi Isira'eelike moyanjuwwiinke jirtetike maxaafa'n borreessende hexxeexxeba? <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Ba'isha reye; Tirtsa giddonna moogeme; belti isiki Ela isixxe bakka'n moye.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi Hanaanika belto wabeeka Iyyu darree'n Ba'isha'ninna isike mini hado'n wabeekummi kulemeexxi daafe; Ba'oosi hujemmaxxe cubboni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta mufachchiisseemmaxxeeteni; Iyyorbi'aamik mini hadi duuchchi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo fuggooxxa huje duuchcha hunjeemmaxxeenna Iyyorbi'aminna isika mini hado shiye bireemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelika Moyanjo Ellaa'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Yihudak moyanji Aasa moyeexxe lame tommenna jaane wogga'ni Ba'ishak belti Ela Isira'eel'i moye; Tirsta hiyyemaaba ofoleexxi lame wogga moye.<verse eid="1KI 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Ja'laabuwwi giddii'ni mitti gamisa lolinxa gaaruwwa ajajalli Zimmri Amitso iso'ni ke'e; ookkoone wodda Ella Tirtsake qachcha'ni mootummatike minike akeekisanjo kade'eke Artsake mine'ni ha'we machcho'eemman. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Zimmrinna ookkone mine'n e'yeexxi Ella'a shiye; isinna Ellaxxe bakka'ni fileme Yihudak moyanji Aasa moyemmaxxe lame tommenna torbaane wogga moye.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Zemiri moyeenge hirba'ninna mootete'n ofo'lemashan; Ba'ishaka mini hado duuchcha shiye bire; fira isikanna jaaluwwa ifika labbaka shiye bire. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Konne qicinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti wabeeka Iyyu darree'ni Ba'isha'ni kuleek raagashsha Zimmiri Ba'ishaka mini hado duuchcha kutti asse bire.<verse eid="1KI 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />Tinni kadde'ek Ba'ishanna belti isik Ela; la'o afebaake misechixxe fakkuwwaxxe buutonni Isira'eelika Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Mageno mufachchiisate'e hunjeexxe cubbo duuchcha'anna; Isira'eeli'i hujaashsha assineemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="1KI 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Ela isike baro'ni wele muuxeexxin asseexxi duuchcha Isira'eelike moyanjuwwiixe jirtetike maxaafa'ni borreessende'en.<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelik Moyanji Zemirii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Yihudaki moyanji Aasa moyeexxe lame tommenna torbaxxe wogga'ni Zimmiri Tirtsa hedhe torbaane barra calla moye. Konne wodda sannachchi Filisixeemik qachcha kade'eka Gibetooni'i buqe abideemman. <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />Ookkone olla'a'ni hedhemmak Isira'eelik ardi Zimmir fuggoxxinni ke'e moyanjo shiyeexxa lanqeeshshanni; sannachchinka ajajallo Omiirii'i eettene barra ookkone olla'in giddo Isira'eeli'ni moosinsexxa lassine. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Omiiri isinni welti hedhemmari Isira'eelika arda duuchcha Gibetooni'ni alale fulleexxi Tirsta'a buqe. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Zimmir qachchi abidemeexxa uude wodda mootummatike mini giddo hedheeke kinjiinke miniba e'yeexxi mootummatike mine giira woreexxi ookkoone reye. <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />Tinni iitta kadde'ek Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo gibendeexxa elobaaxxa huje hujatinna Iyyorbi'aammishsha kadeexxi; ittanni ifi'a hujeexxe cubboxxeenna Isira'eel hujjaashsha asseexxe cubboxxe buuto'aten.<verse eid="1KI 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Zimmir baro isike'n huje'exxi wele hujenna asseexxi fuggoxxi yaane Isira'eelke moyanjuwwike jirtetike maxaafa'ni borreessende'en.<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelk Moyanjo Omiiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelik ardi lameba qoodeme, gamisi Ginaatika belto Taminii'i moosisateete kada wodda, weli gate'ek kinn Omiirii'i kiphatitemman. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Kaddollenna Omiiri'i hordofaammakiir Ginaatike belto Taminii'i hordofamake erra jabaante; tennexxe Tamininna reye; Omiirinna moye.<verse eid="1KI 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Yihuda miyanji Aasa moyeexxe sase tommenna mitte wogga'ni Omiiri Isira'eel'i moye; tommenna lame wogganna moye; konneer giddii'n jaane wogga moyeek Tirtsa hedheeten. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Isinna Semaariyaka tulluchchuwwa lame jaane kuma birretike sibiljinni Samiirii'n hireexxi qachcha ijaare; isika summanna edike eettene koobake anna Samiirike summinni Semaariya hiyye fulche. <verse eid="1KI 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Kaddo malee'e Omiirinna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo fuggoxxa huje huje; isi edo hedhemmakeeri irra hara saxxeexxa cubbo huje. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />Isinna Isira'eel la'o affebaaxxe fakkuwwan Isira'eelika Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni hifataashsha assatte'e Naabaaxik belti Iyyorbi'aami assemmaxxa duuchchanna isi cubbo huje Isira'eelik ardi hujaashsha asse'exxe cubboxxa duuka me'e.<verse eid="1KI 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Omiiri isike baro'ni huje'exxinna asseexxi wele yaane duuchcha Isira'eelke moyanjuwwinke jirtetike maxaafa'ni borreessende'en. <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Omiiri reye; Semaariya moogeme; belti isiki Aki'aab isixxe bakka'ni moye.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aki'abi Isira'eelke Moyanjo Kade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Yihudak moyanji Aasa moyeexxe sase tommenna saddeetixxe wogga'n Omiirik belti Aki'aab Isira'el'i moye; Semaariya hedhe Isira'eel'i lame tommenna lame wogga moye. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Omiirik belti Aki'aab isonaa'ni ediseexxi hedhemmaki duuchchi erra Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo fuggoxxa yaane asse. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Aki'aabi, moyanji Iyyorbi'aami hujeexxa cubbo shollaxxe yaane asse uudati isi iif'aani eettenee cubbo huje; ookkoneechchi uduma duuchchiinxa sa'isse Sidoonaka moyanjo Etiba'aalixxa belto Arimaatichcho Elzabeeli'i aadhe; isinna mari Ba'aal hinammaka mageno magenoonfate; isonna sagade. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />Semaariya ijaaremake Ba'aalika fakkuwwati mine Ba'aali'a tolchimalcho giisse. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Higgeen Aki'aab Asheerixxe fakkexxa sooddo uurrise isi edi darre hedhemmake Isira'eelixxe moyanjuwwi erra Isira'eelka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Mageno mufachchiissaaxxa huje huje.<verse eid="1KI 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />Beeti'eeliki manji Hi'eel; Aki'abike baro'ni Iyyaarikoo hiisse ijaare. Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Neeweke belto Iyyaasu darre'ni haaso'eeki hiyyichchi muuxemaashsha ijaarsa safee wodda angafi belti welti Abiraani reye; dalla'iinxa huluwwa giissa wodda isik maa'nichchi belti Segubi reye.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Eeliyaasi'a Qoodanduwwi Ita Shiqishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Gele'adike boga'ni hedhamakeranaa'ni mitti Teesibixxe gosak Eliyaasi hiyyemaak wabeek moyanjo Aki'aabii'i hiyyee qici, «Ani hiyyaaneshsha kaddoole daggaxxe wogguwwa'ni bogake'ni xeeni yookaani fixxeessi hedhabaaxxa ani ergatemaannek Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike hedhaake Magenke summinni ati'a kulaanene» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:17">Ya'i. 5:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Ookko'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Eelyasii'i hiyyee qici, <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />«Kabaa'ni kexxe borotiba'a me'i; Yordaanoosii'n boroti darre'n hedheeke Koraatike galaani bira hexxeexxe dhooqa'n sho'ome. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Wode'e galaanakena'ni ha'witatton; qoodhanduwwi ookko'o ita ati'a shiqishaashsha ajajeennen» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajemmashan Eeliyaasinna asse; Yordaanoosii'n boroti darre'n hedheeke Koraatike galaani bira ookko'o ofo'le. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Qodhanduwwikinna gorsanna galgala waasakanna maala isi'a idaga'nemman; wode'ekanna galaanakenaa'ni ha'waamman.<verse eid="1KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Seraaphixxa Aro'o Affebaaxxa Manjichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Bogake'ni xeeni gana gopheemmaxxe'e shiixxooxxe yanna uduma galaani gabe. <verse eid="1KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Ookko'ni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Eeliyaasii'i hiyyee qici, <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />«Kexxetexxi Sidoonake boga'ni hexxeexxe Seraaphita marte ofo'li; ookkonna mitte aro'o affebaaxxi hiyyeette manjichcho atee itiso'aa ajajeennen» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:25-26">Luq. 4:25-26</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Tennexxe ke'eexxi Seraaphita'a me'e. Qachchiinxe hulaba geyeeshshann mitte aro'o affe'ebaaxxi hiyyeette manjichcho haasume qocexaa'na'a afe; isee'e ye'eexxi, «Ha'wannoka wede'e ani'a uwwi» hiyye ise'e kadhate. <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Iyyedaggo'a marta wodda higgeeni ye'eexxinna, «Maganneten tima shiixxooka ani'a iitee dagi» ise'e hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Isenna hiissiteexxi isoo'o «Hedhaake Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Magenixxa qalqallote'n hexxeexxe oobo bullenna odolchote'ni hexxeexxe shiixxooxxa zayite malee'e afenneelchi hedhebaan. Kunse ani ifi'aanna belto anke ita qophpheese'na inde rennonna'a haasume qoce mini'a adhe me'onnaaten» hite.<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Eiyaasinna ise'e hiisse hiyyee qici; «Meeco, sodaattoxxe; mine e'yitettexxi hitetteshshanni assi; edise kinni ookkone affettenga shiixxooxxa kebbo kebbisse ani'a aaxxe dagi; ookkoneechchi uduma ati ifi'anna belto atike'e ra'issi. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Isira'eelik Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageni hiyya'nee qici; ‹Duuchchi Woddik Gootti buttatee xeena gansiisaaxxe barra qico'ni; qalqallo giddii'n bulle gophendabaan; odolcho giddii'n zayite muddabaan› » hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Isenna marteexxi Eliyaasi ise'a hiyyemmashshan assite; konne qicinn Eeliyaasi; aro'o affebaaxxi hiyyeettenna mini hadi iseki heddo barra inde. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Eliyaasi'ni kulendeexxe Duuchchi Woddike Goottike hiyyichchishshann qalqallo giddi'ni bulle gophendebaan oddowwa giddi'inna zayite muddeemmabaan.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Shiixoxxe yanna uduma aro'o affebaaxxe manjichchok belti elagophe; dhibotinna itti jabaatte; hafuurikinna fule. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Isenna Eliyaasi'i «Koo Mageniinke manjo; ani atee'e maa'asenne? Cubbo anxa kassi hite belto anka shilitotta'a kaba daggette?» iso'o hite.<verse eid="1KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Eeliyasinna hiisseexxi; «Belto atika aniba iyyedagi,» ise'e hiyye; beltokanna anga isexxenaa'ni aadheexxi isi hedhammaxxe mini iimixxe xellephpho'ni imareexxi taqe ifixxe'n diiphise. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Eeliyaasi qonqo gikki asseexxi, «Ee, Duuchchi Woddike Gootta anke Magenoo! Summa atika tenne aro'i reyeexxe manjichcho'ni mayee'e iitta hexxeexxa wixirri assittaaxxa yaane assitette? Ise anee'e keesunsati lumoxxa elle assite'een; eega ati mayee'e belto iseka reyaashsha assittette?» hiyye'e Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa raare. <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />Beltoke'ni hana sasele wabbi hiyyeexxi, «Ee Duuchchi Woddike Gootta anke Mageno konne beltixxi lubbo higgowwaal!» hiyye'e Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa raare.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:34-35">2 Moy. 4:34-35</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Eliyaasixxa raare laqe; beltiinxi lubbonna higge; beltikinna fayye. <verse eid="1KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Ookko'ni Eliyaasi belto ke'isseexxi mini giddixxe xelephphonaa'ni butti'a dirriseexxi amate'ni, «Belti atik kunniseten; fayye'een!» hiyye ise'a uwwe.<verse eid="1KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Ookkoo'ni manjichcho Eeliyaasi'i, «Ati Duuchchi Woddike Goottike manjo kaddeettexxa; atike afo'onaa'ni fuleek Mageniink hiyyichchi dhugaate kadeexxa ta'a ege'nennen!» iso'o hite.<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Eeliyasinna Abidiyyu'u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Heddo yanna uduma sakkaxxe wogga'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Elyaasi'a hiyyee qici, «Marte Aki'aabi'n leeli; aninna bogake'ni xeena gansiisannon» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Tennexxe Eliyaasii Aki'aabi'n ifi leellisho'a me'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:2">Eettene yanna solo'i Semaariyake boga'n birasa'eemman. <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />Aki'aab mootummatike minika ajajallo Abidiyuu'u ye'e; Abidiyuunna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta yo'oshsha sodataake manjomman. <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />Elizaabeelinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa wabeeko shilshiishshamma wodda, Abidiyu dhibba wabeeko aadheexxi lameba qoode onde onde tomme asse wolo'oti giddo sho'eexxi itanna wode'e insa'ne'a uwwa'nemman. <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Aki'aabinna Abidiyuu'u, «Kexxettexxi bogi giddo hexxeexxe muummebaanna wolo'oba'a mari; fadhaduwwinna gaanguwwa no'oxxi rennabaashsha hedhoti he'naaka arso dedha alfinannoxxe hexxeen» iso'o hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Tennexxe me'inaaka boga qoqqoodemme Aki'aab mitte darre'ni Abidiyunna wele darre'ni me'ine.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Abidiyu me'ande'ni hedhee'na Eliyaasi'i afe; Abidiyyunna iso ege'ne butta wabbi hiyyeexxi anga iimi'a ke'isse; «Koo anke gootta Eelyaasi; isi dhugaandinn atendee?» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Eliyaasinna, «Eeti! Anenden; marte goota atike'e ‹Eeliyaasi kabani hedheen› hite iso'ni kuli» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Abidiyunna iso'o hiyyee qici; «Abbo mayee ate'e maa balleessannalete erganji atik reyaashsha Aki'aabi'n sa'isite uutettechchi. <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Duuchchi Woddika Gootta hedhaaka atika Mageno! Gooti anki ate'e balleesssatee gosa gosake ardina'ninna mootummana'ni ergaa'na gateeng hedhebaan; hoone gosa gosake ardanna kado mootumma ati ookko'o hexxebexxoxxa ege'nishe wodda duuchching ati ookko'o uudebaaxxa dhugeesashsha kakachchiisaamman. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Ta'a kinni ati anke goottiba mare, ‹Eliyaasi kaba hedheen› hiyyona'a hassaatten; <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Ati birii'ni me'anno wodda Duuchchi Woddike Gootti hafuur atee haba aadhe me'aaxxa ege'nabe'non; yoona mare Aki'aabi'n kuleenneechchi uduma ate'e afa gophoole ane'e shiyaan; yaane kinni ani erganji atik dargaggeeyyummandenaa'ninni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta magenoonfataannen. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Koo anke gootta, Elizaabeeli Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa wabeeko shilchiishshee wodda maa assennexxa laqqeettabaa? Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa wabeeko aadhe onde tomme mitte wolo'o'ni onde tomme mitte wolo'o giddo sho'neexxi itanna wode'e insa'ne'a uwwa'nemman; <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Yoona ati mare gootta anke'e ‹Eliyaasi kaba hedheen› hiyyonna'a hassaatten; isinna ane'e shiyaan!» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Eliyaasinna hiyyee qici, «Ani isi edo uurreenneke Dada Duuchcha Ajajaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa, telcho Aki'aabi edo dhugaandinni leellannon» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eeliyaasi Qeermeloosixxe Kooba'ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Tennexxe Abidiyu mareexxi tenneen Aki'aabi'n kule; Aki'abinna Eliyaasi'inni afemo'a me'e. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Aki'aab Eliyaasii'i uudee wodda «Isira'eeli'i rakkissaatteki atetee?» iso'o hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Eeliyaasinna hiisse hiyyee qici: «Atetenna atike annike mini hado rakkisee malee ani Isira'eel'i rakkisebo'non. Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ajaja waaldine'en; Ba'aalinni hordofine'en. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Ta'anna ardi Qermeeloosixxe kooba'ni aninni afemo'a Isira'eelke ardi duuchchi'a lassi. Eelizaabeelixxe qorenaa'ni itta'neexxa shoole dhibbanna onde tomme Ba'aalixxa wabeeko shoole dhibba Asheeraxxa wabeeko iyyedag.»<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Tennexxe Aki'aab Isira'eelike arda duuchcha'ni lassisiisse wabeekonna Qermeeloosixxe kooba'ni bukki asse. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Eliyasinna ardi edo shiqeexxi; «Lame yaadinni erqe kayya daaqqina'neek haaniqico'nite? Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageninke kadoole Mageno hordoffee; Ba'aali dhugaatike magenoke kadoole isoo hordoffe» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:21">Ardi kinni mittelchonna bucuqqi hiyyebaan.<verse eid="1KI 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Ookko'ni Eliyaasi hiyyeeqici, «Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe wabeekonaa'n gatennek ane callan; Ba'aalixxi kinni shooole dhibbanna onde tomme wabeeko hexxeen. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Lame jiboota no'o'a uwwe; insa'nenna mitte fi'line adhdhinowwaal; qooli qoolik wonxe haqichchoke'ni fanninsowwaal; yaane kinni giira konneechchi hunda ha'inshoqqe; aninna langaka jibichcha qophpheessannon; haqichchoke'inna fannisannon; giiranna ha'ishabo'non. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Ookko'o ha'no ha'nooke magenika summa ye'edhdhe; aninna Duuchchi Woddike Goottika summa ye'annon; laqe giirati hiissaak isi dhugaatike Magenon» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:24">Ookkoneechchi uduma ardi duuchchi hiyyee qici, «Hitettexxi eloxxen» hine.<verse eid="1KI 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Eliyaasinna Ba'aalixxe wabeeko, «Ha'no heddoke kadinemmaxxe'e edissine mitte jibichcha fi'litine qophpheesse; ha'nooke magenuwwika summa ye'we; yaane kinni giira ha'ishshinoqqe» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Tennexxe insa'ne'a uuneka jibichcha adhdhine qophpheessine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:26">Ookkoo'ni gorsii'ni barra saafo'iin qico'n Ba'aali ye'e'ne; «Koo Ba'aali no'aa laqi» hina'ni raarre cuqqi hiyyachi kinni hedhemmabaan; hiisa'neek hedhemmabaan; hunjeeke tolchimalchi qarqara'n qeexalle.<verse eid="1KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Barra saafo'ake'n Eliyaasi «Hafuura ha'nooka gikki assitine raartinabaa! Isi magenokebaa! Dedha hedumi giddo hedhaan yookaan huje iso'ni bira saxxe'en ora me'ate'ni hedhaan; dhiiphoolenna ke'isse» hiyya'ni insa'ne'e coorate'ni ke'e. <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Tennexxe baranteemmashshann raarra'ni munde insa'neexxi lolaata qico'ni ifika biso wolaantichchikinna cuupheti madeessinaamman. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Barra saafo'i sa'eechchi uduma insa'nenna galgalik tolchi shiqaa qico'ni wabeekumma haasoonnaamman. Kaddo malee'e ta'anna bucuqqi hiyyaachchi hedhemmabaan; caqase hiissammak hedhemmabaan.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Ookko'ni Eliyaasi arda duuchcha «Anibaa shikki hiyye» hiyye ardi duuchchi isibaa shiqe; isinna diigemeemmaka Duuchchi Woddike Goottika tolchimalcho giisse. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti koonneechi edo «Isira'eel» hiyye summa fulche'eke Ya'iqoobinaa'n ilendeexxe tommenna lame gosake summinni tommenna lame kinjo aadheexxi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Dada. 32:28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:10">35:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Kinuwwate'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottik summi'a tolchimalcho giisse; tolchimalchiinke qarqara'n tommenna onde leetiro wode'e abiddaaxxa bale ume. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Haqqe tolchimalchoke'ni iimi'a giisse tuule; jibichiinka maala qooli qoolik kukkuteechchi uduma haqichchoke'ni iima fannise. Ookko'ninna «Wode'e shoole waaba'ni wonshitine tolchake'ninna haqqete'ni hana dunne» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Higgenni «Ta'anna lebbe!» hiyye, insa'nenna lenbe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:34">«Sakkaxxanna lebbe!» hiyye ajaje insa'nenna sakkassine lenbe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:26">Iya. 6:26</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Wede'i kinni tolchimalchinke qarqara yaa'e; baletanna wo'me.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Galgaliki tolchi shiqammaxxa yanna wabeek Eliyaasi tolchimalchiinba shiqeexxi hiyye soodatee qici, «Ee Abirihaamike, Yissihaaqikenna Isira'eelike Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Magenoo! Ati Isira'eelike Mageno kaddeettexxa; aninna atike erganjo kadeennexxanna tenne duuchcha ajaja atikenna assennexxa techcho ege'nendowwaal. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Kunni ardi ati Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Mageno dhugaatike kaddettexxanna qalbe insa'neexxa hiissitetteki atete kaddettexxa ege'naashsha abbo maganneten soodachcho anxa laqi; Ee, Duuchchi Woddike Gootta maganneten hiissichcho ani'a uwwi.»<verse eid="1KI 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi giira iimii'ni daggeexxi tolcha, haqqe, kinjokanna buttina itte birte; bale giddo hedhemmaka wode'e bassite.<verse eid="1KI 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Tennee uudeeki ardi duuchchi albik buttinake'n gonbiseme. «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Magen isi dhugaatiken! Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti isi dhugaatike Magenon!» hine.<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Ookkoo'n Eeliyaasi «Ba'aalixxa wabeeko abidde! Mitti manjinna baaje fuloqqe'e» hiyye ajaje. Ardikinna insa'ne'e abide; Eliyaasinna Qisoonike galaaniba'a iyyemarre insa'ne'e gorraasise.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Eliyaasinna Aki'aabii'i «Jabaki xeeni gano'a dinddima'neen marte itte ha'wi» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Tennexxe Aki'aab ito'anna ha'wo'a me'e; Eliyaasi kinni Qermeeloosixxe koobaxxe xungo'ni fule; lame gulubixxe oddo'ni albik heeshshi hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Erganjokanna, «Marte abbaayyatiba'a uudi» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Erganjikinna mare uudeexxinna, «Ookko'o hedheechchi hedheban» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Eeliyaasinna torbaanele, «Higgeenna mari» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Torbaxxe yanna'ni erganji «Kunse angatike ba'lnichiqicik shiixxook duucmanchi abbaayyatena'ni ke'a'neeni» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:44">Eeliyasinna hiyyeeqic «Marte Aki'aabii'i ‹Xeeni kutebaangi fadhadiinxa gaare fe'eexxe me'i› hite iso'o kuli» hiyye ajaje.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:18">Ya'i. 5:18</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Iikki woddi duumanchi iima buqe; diidallotinna gande; jabaki xeeninna gane; Aki'aabinna fadhadiinxe gaare'n gulufe Iyyizira'eeli'a me'e. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi hunna Eliyaasi'ni dagge; Eliyaasinna seemma iimi'a hiissedhe mixeti duudhe usudheechchi uduma Iyyizira'eeli qico'n Aki'aab edo gonge.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Eeliyaasi Koorebi'a Baaje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Ookkone wodda Aki'aab, Eliyaasi assammaxxa duuchcha; raagole duuchcha wolaantichchik hitta gorraasisseexxa Elizaabeeli'ni haaso'e. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Tennexxe Elizaabeelinna, «Soodo tenne yanna'ni atixxa lubbonna ookkooneerixxe lubboshshanni assa gophonnole magenuwwi aneenna shiyowwal; tenne caaldeexxanna ane'n iyyedagowwaal» hite Eliyaasibaa manna ergite.<verse eid="1KI 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Eeliyaasinna sodaatemmaxxe'e lubbo gato'a ke'e baaje. Yihudake boga'ni hedheeke Bersaabehike qachchiba'a dageeshshanni erganjo ifika ookkoone waale; <verse eid="1KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />Qiila gammooje giddo barra duuchcha me'e. Isinna Kitikita hinaake haqichchiba geyeexxi hunda ofo'leexxi rewo'a, «Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ani'a gelte'en; ani edika annuwwa anka sa'abo'non lubbo anxa adhdhii!» hiyye soodate. <verse eid="1KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Ookkoonneechchi uduma haqichchi hunda irkateeba diiphe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:5">Dedhange'n iimik erganji le'miseexxi, «Kexxettexxi iti!» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Tamasse uuda wodda; kashiloke'n kossineexxi kebbonna mitte odolcho'ni wode'e umiinba hedhee'na afe; ite ha'we ke'eechi uduma hige diiphe.<verse eid="1KI 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganjinna higgen dage le'miseexxi, «Bayya me'itaattaxxe'e kexxe iti!» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Tennexxe ke'eexxi ite ha'we; ite hunna jabeefateexxi Koorebi Mageniixxe koobaba'a geyaaqico shoole tomme barranna shoole tomme hashsha me'e. <verse eid="1KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Ookko'o wolo'o mitte giddo e'ye gale.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1KI 19:9">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Eeliyaasi'ni Leelle</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:9">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti isoo hiyyee qici, «Eliyaas kaba maa assitaattee?» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />Higgeen isinna «Ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootti Mageni'a yo'oshsha hinaafeennen; Isira'eelik ardi kako atixxa diige'en; tolchimalichuwwa diinge'en; wabeekottanna wolaantichchik shinne'en. Ane calla gateennen; ta'anna anee shinno'a hansa'neen» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:3">Rom. 11:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyyee qici, «Hexxettebaa'n fulde koobatixxe xungo'n ani edo uurri» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:11">Ookkoo'n jabaxxinna hunnaameette diidallo koobuwwa hacaqqi assite; kinuwatanna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo bulleessite birte; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kinni diidalloti giddo hedhemmabaan; diidallote'n itti aande buttinniinxi lele'ma kadde; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kinni buttiniinxe lele'ma giddo hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Buttatixxe lele'ma uduma giira dagge; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kinni giirati giddo hedhemmabaan; giirati uduma laanchiteexxi diidallo gande. <verse eid="1KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Eliyaasi tennee laqeexxi, alba ifika fugatemalchin buqedhe fuleexxi wolootixxe hula'ni uurre.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:13">Ookko'ni «Koo Eeliyaasi kaba maa assitaattee?» hiyyaka hafuura laqe.<verse eid="1KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Isinna «Ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Mageni'a yo'oshsha hinaafeennen; Isira'eelik ardi kako atixxa diige'en; tolchimalcho diige'en; wabeeko atixxanna wolaantichchik shinne'en. Ani calla gateennen; ta'anna anee shinno'a hansa'neen» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna iso'o hiyyee qici, «Daggettenga ora higge Demasiqoxxe qiilla gammoojjebaa me'i; ookko'o geltottole Azaheeli'i Sooriya'n moyaashsha hariiri.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:7-13">2 Moy. 8:7-13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />Iittanni Nimishika belto Iyyunna Isira'eeli'ni moyaashsha hariir; higgeen wabeeko kadeexxi atixxe bakka'n wabeeka kadaashsha Abeeli Mehoolaka manjo Saafaxiinika belto Elsa'ii hariir.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:1-6">2 Moy. 9:1-6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Azaheelike wolaantichchonaa'n baajemmaka Iyyuu shiyaani; Iyyuke wolaantichchonaa'n baaje'eka kin Elsa'i shiyaani. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Aninna Ba'aali magenoonfatebaakanna suumeti fakke sunqedhebaaka torbaane kuma manna Isira'eeli giddo gatisannon» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:4">Rom. 11:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elsa'ixxa Ye'ensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Elsa'i ookko'n ke'e me'a wodda Saafaxiinika belto Elsa'ii tommenna lame qotiyyo fulche ifi'a tommenna langaxxe qotiyyon hucca'na'a afe. Eliyaasinna isiba'a mareexxi fugatemmalcho hana ibise. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Ookko'ni Elsa'i qotiyyuwwa waaleexxi Eliyaasi'i hordofeexxi «Annakanna ama anxa sunqedhe higonna'a ani'a eeti'i uwwi; ookkoneechchi uduma ate hordofannon» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:20">Eliyaasinna hiisseexxi, «Ani ate'e assennelchi hedhee? Wirri hite higa dandeettatton» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Tennexxee Elsa'i waaleexxi hige. Lamiinxa qotiyyo dule; huccammake miya'ninna giira ha'isheexxi maala gafe ardake'e uwwe insa'nenna inde. Ookko'n Eliyaasii'i hordofe me'eexxi gargaara'nemman.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Been Hadaadi Samariya'a Lole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Sooriyaki moyanji Beenihadaadi sannachcha duuchcha mitteba kukki asse; isinni welti sase tommenna lame moyanjuwwi fadhaduwwikinna fadhadiinxe loliinxe gaaruwwan isi welti he'nemman; duulo fuleexxi Semaariya elqe kayyii'ni buqe lole. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Isinna qachchi giddi'a manjo ergeexxi Isira'eelik moyanjo Aki'aabii'i hiyyee qici; «Beenihadadi hiyya'nee qici <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />‹Sibiljiinxi birrenna worqe anxen; dadanchallamma aruwwa atixinna oose atixxi anxen› » hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Isira'eelik moyanji, «Koo anke gootta moyanjo ati hitettexxi dhugaaten aninna ani horatennelchi duuchchi atiken» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Erga mare'emmak manninna higgeen dage hiyyee qici: «Beenihadaadi hiyya'nee qici, ‹Birretika sibljonna worqe atixxa, aruwwa atixxanna oose atixxa ani'a uutotta'a atiba'a manjo ergaannen. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Ta'a kinni soodo iitte wodda atika mootummatika minenna ja'laabuwwa atikika mine saamo'a ja'laabuwwa anka atiba'a ergannon. Insa'nenna hira ati'a fulchaachcho duuchcha adhdhine dangaan.› »<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Isira'eelik moyanjinna bogi ifikixxa geedhe duuchchi eyeexxi, «Kunni manji lola harsa'nee qico uudde; aruwwa anxanna oose anxa birretika sibiljonna worqe anxa isi'a uwwona'a anee laqee wodda hoyyedhebe'non» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Geedhuwwatinna ardi duuchchi, «Isi hiyyaaxxa laqqoxxe; isi laqedhaachchonna eetti hitoxxe» hine.<verse eid="1KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Tennexxee Beenihadaadiki erganjuwwi «Gootta anke moyanji'a, ‹Ani atik erganji sirete'n laqqettexxa duuchcha assannon; ta'ika qortuma kinni muuxa dande'abe'non› hitine iso'ni kulle» hiyye. Erganjuwwi isikinna tennee erga adhdhine hinge.<verse eid="1KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Ookkoo'ni Beenihadaadi «Anee hordofaake manni duuchchi'a Semaariyak buttinna mitte mitte oobo geessisa gophoonnole magenuwwi ane'e qooma shiyo; tenne saxxeexxanna ane'n geessiso!» hiyye wele erganjuwwa Akaabiba'a erge.<verse eid="1KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Isira'eelik moyanjinna, « ‹Lolakee ka'le fulaaki manji loliinka imaana tilqeeke manjishsha geerara hasissabaan› hitine iso'ni kulle» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Beenihadadi tennee erga laqee welti hedhemmak moyanjuwwi ifike duunkaan giddo hedhee ha'waamma wodda Beenihadadi manna «Ke'we duulokee qophpheeffatte» hiyye. Tennexxee insa'ne qachcha lollo'a qophpheeffante.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aki'aabi Beenhadadi'i Lole Injifate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Ookkone wodda mitti wabeek Isira'eelike moyanjo Aki'aabibaa dageexxi, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici: ‹Konnee heddo loliinka sannachcha uuda'ninn hexxette? Techcho anga atixxe'n insa'nee sa'isse uwwannon; ookko'ni Ani Duuchchi Wooddike Gootta kadennexxa egendattoni› atee hiyya'neen.»<verse eid="1KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Aki'aabinna «Tennee assa'neek ayyetesi?» hiyye isoo laqe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Iikki wabeekinna, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici, ‹Tennee assa'neeki Awiraaji Awiraajik loliinke mannike dargageeye ajajalluwwan› » hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">«Yoona lola edise safa'neek ayyete?» hiyye laqe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Iikki wabeekinna «Atinni edisse saffaton?» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Tennexxee Aki'abi Awiraaji Awiraajika lame dhibba sase tommenna lame loliinke mannik ajajjalluwwa kaddeexxa dargaggeeyye ye'e ookko'ni gatteeka Isira'eelika manna bukki asse; insa'nek laakkoossinna torbaane kumamman. <verse eid="1KI 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Insa'nenna Beenhadaadinna isinne welti gudde'emmak sase tommenna lame moyanjuwwi duunkaana ifiki giddo ha'wine machchoonnee'naa barra saafo'a dange. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />Edise umoke'n fuleemmakiir Awiraaji Awiraajixxe loliinke mannike ajajalluwwa kadde'eexxe dargaaggeeyummani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:17">Konne wodda Beenihadaadi to'ataaka manna ergeemman; insa'nenna «Semaariya'n manni fule'e kaba'a dagate'n hedheeni» hine iso'ni kulle.<verse eid="1KI 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Isinna, «Insa'nexxi daga nage'akeetemoo lolakeete lubbondinni he'nee'na aaxxine dagge» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Awiraj Awiraajinxi loliinke mannikee ajajaluwwa kadde'exxi dargaggeeyye loliinka sannachcha a'lite qachchi giddi'n fulde. <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />Mitti mitting lolake'ni kiphphi hiyyeeka naapha shiye; Sooraki manninna baaje Isira'eelik ardinna shorrate'n ke'e. Sooriyaki moyanji Beenihadaadi kinn fadhachchoke'ni gulufe heenooke fadhado gulufe'eke manninni welti baaje fule. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Isira'eelik moyanji Aki'abinna edi'a gussati fadhadokanna fadhadiinxa gaaruwwa boojiwwe; Sooriyake manna'ninna fuggo lole miidhe.<verse eid="1KI 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma iikki wabeek Isira'eelike moyanjiibaa dageexxi, «Dagaake Birra'atike agenjo'n Sooriyaki moyanji langaxxanna atee lolo'a hige dagaani jabaati; maa assitattoxxa atinni egendeetteni» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Eettene yanna'n Sooriyake moyanjiki Ja'laabuwwi hiyye iso'o gorrisee qici, «Insa'neki magenuwwi tullichchuwwiinke magenuwwaani no'o injifanteechchi tennenaa'n kexxeexxeni. Diidake'n insa'ne lolleennele kinni insa'ne injifantannani. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Yoona assitatto qici; moyanjuwwa duuchcha ajajallummatenaa'n hoyyite; insa'nexxe bakaa'n wele loliinke mannika ajajaluwwa hariiri. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Isira'eelinni welti diidake'n lola inbaashsha mudemmake fadhadixxa bakka fadhado, mudemmaxxa loliinxe fadhadiinxe gaarexxa bakka fadhadiinxa gaare bakkate'n hiissite; konneechchi edo lolake'n mudemake manni qicika loliinka manna qophpheessi; ookkoneechchi uduma insa'ne dhugaandini injifantannoni» Moyanjikinna insa'ne shiqinsheeka yaada adhdheexxi hinemmashanni asse.<verse eid="1KI 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Higgeeke birra'atike agenjo'n Beenidadaadi Sooriyaka manna bukki asseexxi Isira'eel lolo'a Afeeqi'a me'e. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Isira'eelinna iittaanni bukki hiteexxi gala'a uuneechchi uduma welti lola ibbo'a bukki hite fulde. Sooriyaki manni boga wo'meemmani; Isira'eel kinni lame shiixxaramma re'etike bobba'ishsha hedhe insa'ne edigama bakka abixxe ofo'le.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Mageniinki manjinna dageexxi Isira'eelike moyanji'a, «Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, ‹Sooriyaki manni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti tullichchiinke mageno malee'e dhooqatike Magenobaani hiyye'eni konnee laakkoonne dhaqqanbabaaka loliinka manna anga atixxe'n sa'ise uwwannoni; atinna ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootta kadeennexxa egendattoni› » hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Bakka abixxine ofollemmange boncho'n weli eriqe kayya uunda'n torbaane barra turree uduma torbaaxxe barra'n welti lola inbe. Isira'eeliki manni eettene barra'n Sooriyaka loliinka manna dhibba kuma shiye. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Gatemmaki Sooriyaki loliinki manni Afeeqike qachcha'n baaje; ookkoonna lame tommenna torbaane kuma loliinke manna'n kinjinki dalla'i fottoqeexxi insa'ne'n hana ibe. Beenihadaadinna qachchi giddi'a baajeexxi mitte minixxe kuta'n e'yeexxi sho'ome.<verse eid="1KI 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Isiki Ja'laabuwwinna, «Isira'eeliki moyanjuwwi gattowwaali hiyyake kadeexxa lanqeenneni; ta'a ke'nennexxi muddeexxa seemma oddo'wine, umo no'oke'n wodaro miriqe'nennexxi Isira'eelike moyanjiba marro; dedha lubbo atixxa gatisaake kadaani» hine.<verse eid="1KI 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Insa'nenna hidhake'n muddeexxa seemma usudhdhineexxi umoke'n wodaro mirqe'neexxi Isira'eelike moyanjiba'a marreexxi; «Atiki eriganji Beenihadaadi ‹Maganneteni anee shiltoxxe› hiyye ate'e kadhata'neeni» hine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:32">Moyanjikinna, «Ta'i qico'n lubbondinni hedhee? Isiqqa dayyo ankeni» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Mannikinna tenne eloxxe hiyyeeshsha asse'e hiyyichcho isika qophe'neexxi; «Eeti Beenihadaadi dayyo atikeni» hine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Moyanjikinna, «Martineexxi iso'o iyyedagge» insa'ne hiyye; Beeni Hadaadi daggee wodda; Aki'abi fadhadiinxe gaare'n ofo'laashsha asse.<verse eid="1KI 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Beeni Hadadinna, «Anni anki Anna atikenaa'n aadheemmaka qachchuwwa hiissannoni; Anni anki Semaariya assemmaxxa duuchcha; atina Demasiqo giddo ifixxa dikko uurrisa dandeettattoni» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:34">Aki'abina «Yoona ani tennee weli aaggonni atee tuqeechchi hedhebaangi wocci assannoni» hiyye; tennexxee isinni welti weli angeechchi uduma isoo me'o'aa waale.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mitti Wabeek Aki'aabi'n Murte Mureexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Wabeekotixxe oosenaa'n mitti jaalo ifika Duuchchi Woddike Goottike hiyyichchi'a ajajemeexxi; «Ane'e gani,» hiyye. Manjichchi kinna gana gibe.<verse eid="1KI 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Tennexxee iikki wabeek, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyyexxe'n ajajema gophpheettaxxe; ani biri'n kexxe me'itatto wodda neenqi atee shiyaani» hiyye. Manjikinna me'echchi uduma neenqi afeexxi iso'o shiye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:24">1 Moy. 13:24</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Iikki wabeekinna wele manjo afeexxi, «Maganneteni ane'e gani» hiyye. Tennexxee iikki manji gane madeesse. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Ookkoo'n iikki wabeek me'e oriini qarqara uureexxi; moyanji dagaaxxa heqqedha'nemmaani. Umoke'n mirqedhemmalcho umokenaa'n hoyyedheexxi illetanna buqedheexxi; iso'o egennabaashsha assee. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Moyanjikinna ookko'n sa'a wodda wabeek isoo ye'exxi hiyyee qici, «Ani eriganji atiki eebbeeke loli giddo e'ye hedhee'na'a mitti manjichchi booji'emeeka manjo aadhe dageexxi ‹Konne manjichcho heqqi; isi ba'oole kinni ati isixxa bakka rertattoni; yookaani torbaane tommenna onde birretika sibiljo uutattoni› anee hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Yooni ani atiki garbichchi huje ane'n bira saxxe'na'a elqenna kayya marema'na'a manjichchi ba'e me'e.»<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Ookkoneechchi uduma iikki wabeek umoke'n mirqedheemmachcho rake illetenaa'n hoyyedhe; Isira'eeliki moyanjinna iikki manji wabeekotenaa'n mitteke kadeexxa ege'ne. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Wabeekinna moyanjo hiyyee qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici, ‹Ani hara reyowwaali› hiyyenneka manjo waaldettaxxe isixxa bakka ati rerittattoni; isike ardixxa bakka atik ardi mudaani» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Isira'eeliki moyanjinna aare mufateexxi Semaariya hedheke moyatike minibaa me'e.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Naabuteka Woyinetike Hiddichchika Fichcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Shiixxooxxe yanna uduma Iyizira'eelichcho Naabutek woyinetke hiddichchike fichcha'n mitte yaane kadde; fichchikinna Iyyizira'eeli giddo Semaariyake moyanjike Aki'aabike moyetike mini birammani. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Aki'aabinna Naabutee, «Woyinetike hiddichchiki atiki fichchi moyatike anke mini bira kademmaxxe hiddichchuwwiinke fichcha assedhonna'a ani'a waali ookkonee fichchixxa bakka wele sa'eeka fichcha ati'a uwwannoni; kadaani hitotole fichchi fulchaaxxa birre ati'a uwwannoni» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Naabutenna kinni «Konnee woyinetike hiddichchika fichcha edike anke Annuwwanaa'n geego adhdheenneken; ati'a uwwateenaa'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ane gatiso'o» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1KI 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Aki'aab, Iyyizira'eelichchi Naabute «Annuwwa ankenaa'n adhdhenneka qadaada ati'a uwwabe'no!» hiyyemmaxxe Aki'aabi mufati bojogema'n ifike mine'n e'ye; mufateexxinna taqete'n sa'e diiphe; itatanna gibe.<verse eid="1KI 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Are isixxinna Elizaabeeli isibri'a shiqqeexxi; «Konne qico ate'e aarsee'na ita gibbettelchi mayeete?» hite qorte.<verse eid="1KI 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Isinna, «Iyyizira'eelichcho Naabute'e ise'n, ‹Woyinetike hiddichchiinka fichcha ane'n gurguri; eetottole konnee fichchixxa bakka wele ati'a uwwannoni› hiyyenneni; isinna kinni; ‹Anka woyinetike hiddichchika fichcha ati'a uwwabo'noni› hiyyemmaxxeeteni» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Are isixxi Elizaabeelinna; «Ati ta'a Isira'eelike moyanjoni; kexxettexxi ita iti; gammadi; Iyyizira'eelichcho Naabuteka woyinetike hiddichchika fichcha ani ati'a uwwissaanoni!» hite.<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Tennexxee borro borreessiteexxi Aki'aabike summinni beessisa uggiteexxi Naabuteke qachcha'n isinni welti hedha'neeke Ja'labuwwi'anna geedhuwwate ergte. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Borrotanna hite borreessitee qici, «Barra mitte agabo goddo honsaashsha lasse; Naabutenna ardi giddo eloke booncho'n ofo'lishshe. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Iittanni lame dhariki dhugaa kuldaaxxa dhuga'a isi edi dare ofo'lishshinee'na'a ‹Magenokanna moyanjo yowwe'eni› hite dhugaa kuldowwaali. Ookkoneechchi uduma Naabute'e qachchi gadho fulchitine kinjik cancaqqine shiwwe.»<verse eid="1KI 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Tennexxee Naabuteke qachcha'n hedha'neeki Ja'laabuwwinna geedhe Elizaabeeli borrote'n hite borreessitemmashshani assine. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Mitte barra agabo goddo honsaashsha lassine; Naabutenna ardi giddo eloke booncho'n ofo'lnshe. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Ookko lame dhara dhugaa kuldaammaxxi dhuga'a isi edi darre ofolde; ardi edo «Naabute Magenokanna moyanjo yowwe'eeni» hite dhugaa kulde. Tennexxee qachchini gadho adhdhine me'ineexxi kinjki cancanqe shinne. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Elizaabeeli'n «Naabute'e kinjki cancanqe shine'eni» hine erga ergine.<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Elizaabeelinna kinjiki cancanqe shiinneexxa laqqeeshshaani; Aki'aabii'i, «Naabute kinjiki cancanqe shinne'eeni; kexxettexxi Iyyizira'eelichchi Naabute ate'n gurgura gibemmaka woyinetike hiddichchika fichcha ifike assexxe adhdhi» hite. <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Aki'aab Naabutexxa reyexxa laqeexxi Naabuteka woyinetike hiddichchika fichcha ifike geego asedhdho'a ke'e me'e.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Teesibichcho Eliyaasi'a hiyyee qici, <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />«Semaariyake moyajo Aki'aabiba kexxe mari; Naabuteka woyinetike hiddichchika fichcha geego ifike asedho'a mare'e ta'a ookko hedheeni. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />Isoo hitatto qici, ‹Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici, Naabutee shiltetexxi hanqattammale kara isixxa dhaaldota'ateeta?› Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici ‹wonshi Naabutexxa munde araphphemmaxxe baka'n atixxa mundenna wonshi iittanni arraaphphaani!› » <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:38">1 Moy. 22:38</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Aki'aabinna Eliyaasii'i «Koo anke naapha! Ane'e affette kinni?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 21:20">Eliyaasinna hiisse hiyyee qici, Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo gibendeexxa yaane assitotta'a ifi gurgudhiteettaxxe'e «eetti! Atee afeenneni. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />‹Kunni ate'n bala ibisannoni; sanne atixxixxa bakka hara balleessannoni; garbakenna kadi ca'ichcha mitte mittenga Aki'aabika maa'nichcho belto Isra'elinaa'n bakka balleessannoni› <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />Ane mufachchiissettaxxeenna Isira'eeli dedhissettaxxe mini hado atika Naabaaxika belto Iyyorbi'aamike mini hadishsha; Akiyake beltike Ba'ishake mini hadishsha assannoni.<verse eid="1KI 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />«Elizaabeelixxenna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici, ‹Iyyizira'eelike dalla'i bira wonshi Elzabel'i itaani› hiyya'neeni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:36">2 Moy. 9:36</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />«Iittanni Aki'aabike fira kadeexxi qachchi giddo reyekaara wonshi itaan; hadi giddo reyeeka allaattuwwa ittaan.»<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />Are ifixxi Elizaabeeli tirtirsitee'na Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo fuggo assate'e Aki'aabishsha ifi sa'isse uwweedheek manji ijje hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eel edii'ni shorre'ek Amoorik manni duuchchi assemmashshan, isinna fakkuwwa magenoofatat hara gibissaaxxa batte yaane asse.<verse eid="1KI 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Aki'aab konnee hiyyichcho laqeexxa yanna seemma fulchedhe dooniyya oddo'weexxi agabo goddo sa'isse; dooniyate'ninna diiphe; yaade hangulli hiyyenna me'aamman.<verse eid="1KI 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Ookko'ninna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Teesibichcho Eliyaasi'n hiyyee qici <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />«Aki'aab ani edo ifi hitta salphiseexxa uuddeetten? Ifi salphisemmaxxe'e yoona tenne bala hedhoti barqico'n iso'o assabo'non; yaane kinni tennee bala mine isike'n ibisaannek isike beltike baro'niten.»<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Mikiyaasi Aki'abi'ni Raaga Raage</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:2-27">2 Odo. 18:2-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Sooriyaxxenna Isira'eelixxe oddo'ni sase wogga'a loli hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Sakkaxxe wogga'n kinni Yihudak moyanji Iyyosafixxi Isira'eelika moyanjo to'atate'e dirre <verse eid="1KI 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Isira'eelk moyanjinna ja'laabuwwa, «Gele'adike boga'n hexxeexxi Raamoti no'oxxe kaddee'naan, Sooriyake moyanjixxe anganaa'n ibisatee higge'e mitte wo'laanchonna assineebe'noxxa egendinebaa?» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Tennexxee Iyyosafixxinna, «Gele'adike boga'n hexxeexxa Raamotii'i lolate'e aninni welti duulo duuldottaa eetaatte?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:4">Iyyosafixxinna, «Aninna atishshanden; anki ardinna atike ardishshanden; anki fadhaduwwinna atike fadhaduwwishshanden» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Iyyosafixinna Isira'eelika moyanjo, «Edisse kinni Duuchchi Woddike Goottika yaada laqi» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Tennexxee Isira'eelik moyanji shoole dhibba wabeeko bukki asseexxi, «Gele'adike boga'n hexxeexxe Raamoti'ni duullannomo waallanno?» hiyye insa'ne'e qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:6">Insa'nenna, «dada duuchchi Gootti moyanjiinxe anga'ni sa'isse uwwaan duuli» hine.<verse eid="1KI 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Iyyosafixxi kinn, «Qodhdhinaannek Duuchchi Woddike Goottik wabeek kaba hedhebaa hiyyatee?»<verse eid="1KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Isira'eelik moyanjinna Iyyosafixi'i, «Yimilak belti Mikiyaasi hiyyemaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottika yaada qodhdhinaak manji hedha hedhenni hedheen yaane kinn heene yanna'ninna kaddo anxee fuggoxxa malee'e eloka raaga haaso'e ege'na gophemmaxxe'e ani iso'o eeyyabe'non!» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:8">Iyyosafixinna, «Moyanjo iitta hiyya hasissabaan!» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Tennexxee Isira'eelik moyanji ja'laabuwwi giddii'n mitte ye'exxi, «Amo mee Yimilaka belto Mikiyaasi'i rakke aaxxe dag» hiyye ajaje.<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Isira'eelik moyajinna Yihudake moyanji Iyyosafixxi mootummatike minixxa seema oddo'wineexxi, Semaariyake dalla'iinxe hula bira hexxeexxe weldeenna'ni moote ifinxe'n ofolee'naa, duuchchiinxi wabeeko insa'ne edo raaga haasota'emman.<verse eid="1KI 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Konne wodda Sedeqiyaasite hiyyemaak Kena'aanik belti sageettot gaafa giisseexxi, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti, ‹Kutti hine mundaa qico'ni Sooriyaka manna konneechchuwwin loldatton› » hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Gatteexxi wabeeko duuchchanna, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti moyanjiinxe anga'n Gele'adike boga'ni hexxeexxa Raamoti'i sa'isse uwwani marte loli» hina'ni mitte afo'o kande raaga raanga'nemma.<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Mikiyaasii'i ye'a mareeki erganji, «Kunse wele wabeeko moyanji lole injifataaxxa mitte afo'o kaddeexxi isi'a raggaammaxxee atik hiyyichchinna insa'neekenni welt mitteke kadaashsha maganne eloxxa haaso'i» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Mikiyaasi kin, «Hedhaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa isi'a haaso'aannek Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ane'ni haaso'exxe callani!» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Ookko'o geyeeshshann moyanji, «Koo Mikiyaasi Gele'adi'i hexxeexxe Raamoti'ni duullannomoo yookaan waallanno?» hiyye iso'o laqe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:15">Isinna, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti moyanjiinxe anga'ni Remaati'i sa'isse uwwaammaxxee duulde injifat» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1KI 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Moyanji kinna «Dhugaa malee'e Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni wele mittechchonna haasoottaboxxoshsha me'ele atee kakachchisanno?» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Ookkoo'ni Mikiyaasi hiyye hiissee qic, «Isira'eeli duuchcha allalisanjo afeebaake gedhebishsha kooba koobate'n xexxeerende'naa uudenne; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, ‹Kunni ardi gootta afebaan; mitti mittingi nage'ik ifi ifike miniba'a nage'ik me'owwaal› hiyye hiise haaso'e.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Lak. 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat. 9:36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar. 6:34</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Isira'eelik moyanji Iyyosafixxi'n, «Isi anxee fuggoxxa malee'e eloka raaga ragabaan hiyyeennabaa?» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Ookkoo'ni Mikiyaasi hiyyee qic, «Yoona Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hiyyichi hiyya'neexxa laqi! Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ifixxe moote'n ofo'le, iimatiki sannachchi duuchchi isike midda'ninna bita'i darree'ni uurre'naa uudeennen;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:1">Isa. 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:6">Iya. 1:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, ‹Gele'adi hexxeexxe Raamoti'ni duule ookkonni reyaashsha ayyete mare Aki'aabii'i dedhisaak ayyete?›</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:20">«Erganna giddii'ni mitti wele, welkinna wele gargar hedheeka yaada shiqinshaamman. <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Udu'meexxi mitti hafuur shiqe; ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edo uurreexxi, ‹Ani isoo dedhisannon› hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />« ‹Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, hitta assite'e?› hiyye isoo qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">« ‹Iikki hafuurinna ani marennexxi wabeeko duuchchik afo'o'ni dharichcha hafuura kadannon› hiyye hiise haaso'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">«‹Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna: Yoona kexxe marte dedhisi ati'a qabbaan› hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />«Tennexxee kunse Duuchchi Woddik Gootti tenne wabeekoke afo'o duuchcha'n dhariinka hafuura ugge; ate hananna bala iyyedaga'neexxa Duuchchi Woddik Gootti haasodheen.»<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Ookko'n Kena'aanik belti Sedeqiyaasi fuleexxi Mikiyaasii'i kabalati ganeexxi, «Haanichchinni kayyi'a Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hafuur anenaa'ni sa'e ate'ni dage haaso'eek?» hiyye qore.<verse eid="1KI 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Mikiyaasinna, «Yoona sho'ondota'a mitte mine'n me'ittattoxxa barra egendattoni» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelik moyanji hiyye ajajee qici, «Amme Mikiyaasii'i abiddineexxi ookkone qachcha galchammake Amoonibaanna moyanjinke belto Iyyo'asibaa ille iima hiisse. <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />Ookkoneechchi ‹Moyanji nage'ik higanno qico'ni konne manjichcho usurriinke mine'n turaashsha asse; bagoka buudeenanna wode'e malee'e weleechcho isi'a uutinoqqe'e› hiyye'en hitine kulle» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Mikiyaasinna «Ati nage'ik higgottole Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ane'ni haaso'eebaani hiyyatebaa!» hiyye. Iitti aanseexxi «Kaba hexxetteki ardi duuchchi konne anka hiyyichcho qalbeeffatte galchedhi» hiyye.<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aki'aabi Gele'aadi Giddo Hedheeke Remaatike Qachcha'n Shiyeme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:28-34">2 Odo. 18:28-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Tennexxee Isira'eelik moyanjinna Yihudak moyanji Iyyosafixxi Gele'adike bogi giddo hedheeke Raamotike qachchibaa qabante. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Aki'aabinna Iyyosafixxii'i, «Ege'nemabe'noshsha seemma jijjiidhe'e wele manjo fakkaate e'yannon; ati kinni atixxa mootummatixxa seemma oddo'wi» hiyye. Tennexxee Isira'eelik moyanji ifi sho'edheexxi loliibaa e'ye.<verse eid="1KI 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Ookkonee wodda Sooriyak moyanji ifika sase tommenna lame sarageelluwwiinka ajajalluwwa, «Isira'eelike moyanji gadhi darre lumokenninna kadi shiixxookenni ayyinninna lola ibbinabaashsha» hiyye insa'nee ajajeemman. <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Iikki sarageelluwwiink ajajaalluwwinna Iyyosaafixi'i uudaa wodda, «Mitte mami belo kunni Isira'eelike moyanjon» hiye. Tennexxee lolle miino'a isoo bunqe; Iyyosafixxi raaree wodda kinni <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />iikki sarageelluwwiink ajajaalluwwi isi Isira'eelike moyanjo kadebaaxxa egenneexxi isoo hordofa waalle.<verse eid="1KI 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Yaane kinni mitti manjichchi dedhange'n ifika mogido alaamebaang ittanni darbaa wodda Isira'eelike moyanjixxi loliinxi seemma welti abidendeeemmabaa'n isoo ote; moyanjikinna ifika sarageella oofammaka, «Mado'ennexxee sarageella udumi'a wirri assite anee tenne loliinxe bakkanaa'n fulchi!» hiyye. <verse eid="1KI 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Barra duuchcha lolikinna qiidebaan; eettene yanna'ni moyanji Sooriyake manni edo ifike loliinke sarageella'n toggi hiyye irkateeshanni hedhemman; mado'emabaa'ni yaatammaxxi munde ookkone loliinke sarageellixxe fa'wo hana coccoba'nemman; eettene barraxxe hashsha'ninni moyanjikinna reye. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Arsho aaggo shiqqee'naa loliinke sannachchuwwi giddii'n «Mitti mitting manji ifi ifike minibaanna ifi ifike bogibaanna me'owwaal!» hiyyemaaki canci ke'e.<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Moyanji Aki'abi reyemmaxxee isoo Semaariya iyyedange moonge. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Ookkone loliinka sarageellanna yabaabuluwwi anshedhammake Semaariyake baleessa'ni anshine; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti haso'emmake hiyyichchishanni isixxa munde wonshi arraaphphe.<verse eid="1KI 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Wele Aki'aab moye galchammake baro'n kaddeexxinna assemmaxxi duuchcha, mootummatika mine ijaaremmaxxinna Daane'inxe isson seeseemmaxxi, iittanni ijaaremmak kollifachchotik qachchuwwi Isira'eelike moyanjuwwike jirtetike maxaafa'ni borreessendee hexxeen. <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Aki'aabinna reye; belti isiki Akaziyaasinna isixxe bakka'ni moye.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuhudaka Mayanjo Iyyosafixii'i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 20:31-21:1">2 Odo. 20:31—21:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Isira'eelik moyanji Aki'aab moye galcheexxe sholgaxxe wogga'ni Aasaki belti Iyyosafixxi Yihuda giddo moye; <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Iyyosafixxi moyaa wodda isixxi wogganna sase tommenna onde woggamman; isinna Iyyerusaalemi'n lame tommenna onde wogga moye. Ama isixxi Azuuba hiyyendaaxxen; isenna Shiilihixxe beltomman. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Isinna anni ifiki Aasa me'emmaka ora me'e; isibaaninna mishikki hiyyebaan; Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo eloxxa calla asse; kaddo malee'e tullichchuwwiinxa magenoonfachchotixxa bakkaara balleessemmabaan; ardikinna ookko'o tolcha tolcha'n hixaanakanna guphpha'nemman. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Iittanni Iyyosafixxi Isira'eelike moyanji welti nage'ik hedhate'n ke'e.<verse eid="1KI 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Wele Iyyosafixxi moyemmake baro'ni muuxemmaxxi lolake'n asseexxinna hujeexxi duuchchi Yihudake moyanjuwwiinke jirtetike maxaafa'ni borreessendee hexxeen. <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Anna ifike Aasake bari uduma midde fakkuwwitixxe magenoonfachchotixxe bakkaara'ni gatteemaxxa labbaki labbakenni meyyaxxi meyyanni wel wel aadhdhammake mannixxa hafe ookkone bogikenaa'ni fugusse.<verse eid="1KI 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Ookkone wodda Eedoomik bogi ifika moyanjo affemmabaan; baalloma'emmak manjinna isoo galcha'emman.<verse eid="1KI 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Iyyosafixxi worqe iyyedago'a Ofiiri'a me'aaka daddaliinka markabuwwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotixxi tika Terseesika markabuwwa hitaan </char></note> giissiseemman; kaddo malee'e iikki markabuwwi abbaayyatixxe gabala kaddeexxe Etsiyonigabiiri'n enqemeemmaxxee hara ookko'a me'a dandeesiseeba'a. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Ookkone wodda Aki'aabik belti Akaaziyaasi Iyyosafixxii'i, «Anki manni atike manni welti markabake'n me'uuni» hiyyeexxi isoo laqeemman. Iyyosafixi kinni eetii'i uwweemmabaan.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Iyyosafixxi reye; isik annuwwi moogemeemmake Daawwitike qachcha'ni moogeeme. Belti isik Iyyoraaminna isixxe bakka'n moye.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelik Moyanjo Aki'aziyaasii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Yihudak mayanji Iyyosafixxi moyemmaxxe tommenna torbaxxe wogga'ni Aki'aabik belti Akaaziyaasi Isira'eelike moyanjo kadeexxi Semaariya'n hedheexxi moye; Isira'eeli'ninna lame wogga moye. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Isinna ifika annanna ifixxa ama iittanni Isira'eelii'i dedhisemmaka Naabaaxika belto Iyyorbi'aamika ora hordofati Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo gibendeexxa fuggoxxa huje asse <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />Ifik anni assemmashshanni isinna Ba'aali'ite hiyyemaaka magenuwwa magenoonfata'n sagade. Ookkonna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelik Mageni mufataashsha asse.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>